window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b053-7b059c9b5b20fcd5.json"]={sha256:"7b059c9b5b20fcd53bf7d7b7804a3deb2a8b5753af4fd07d7c420c0101c61f43",value:{"id":"b053","title":"橋面超高性能混凝土接縫","titleEn":"UHPC bridge-deck closure joints","category":"structures","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從快速橋梁施工中預鑄橋面板接縫的荷載路徑出發，說明超高性能混凝土為何能以約 150 mm 寬的接縫完成鋼筋非接觸搭接，量化介面應力、收縮約束、搭接長度與鋼纖維用量，再處理介面粗糙化、模板密封與溢流、流度與強度驗收、接縫性能監測、氯離子耐久與交接維修，並以紐約州 2009 年首批現澆 UHPC 接縫與 2013 年 I-81 雪城四座橋的 10 天封路更換為例。","summaryEn":"Starting from the load path through joints between precast deck elements in accelerated bridge construction, explain why ultra-high-performance concrete completes non-contact lap splices in joints about 150 mm wide, quantify interface stress, restrained shrinkage, lap length and steel-fibre content, then cover interface roughening, form sealing and overfill, flow and strength acceptance, joint performance monitoring, chloride durability and handover and repair, using New York's first field-cast UHPC connections in 2009 and the 2013 replacement of four I-81 bridges in Syracuse under 10-day closures.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、吊裝或張拉作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, lifting or stressing permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"st-bridge-durability-monitoring","subcategoryTitle":"橋梁耐久、檢測與健康監測","subcategoryTitleEn":"Bridge durability, inspection and health monitoring","learningTrack":"structures","learningSubdiscipline":"st-bridge-durability-monitoring","learningTags":["structures","st-bridge-durability-monitoring","deck"],"architectureFamily":"deck","architectureNodes":[["預鑄橋面板與伸出筋","Precast panels and projecting bars"],["UHPC 接縫與鋼纖維","UHPC joint and steel fibres"],["粗糙化介面","Roughened interface"],["模板、澆置與養護","Formwork, placement and curing"],["驗收試驗與滲水檢查","Acceptance tests and leak checks"],["耐久維護與交接紀錄","Durability upkeep and handover records"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[2,1],[0,2],[3,1],[1,4],[4,5],[2,5]],"diagram":{"type":"deck","labels":["預鑄橋面板與伸出筋","UHPC 接縫與鋼纖維","粗糙化介面","模板、澆置與養護","驗收試驗與滲水檢查"],"labelsEn":["Precast panels and projecting bars","UHPC joint and steel fibres","Roughened interface","Formwork, placement and curing","Acceptance tests and leak checks"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計練習：兩塊全深度預鑄橋面板厚 200 mm，以 UHPC 橫向接縫連接，伸出 16 mm 鋼筋@150 mm（f_y = 420 MPa，低於 75 ksi），保護層 50 mm（≥ 3d_b = 48 mm）。依 FHWA 規則 ℓ_d = 8d_b = 128 mm、ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm，採 120 mm 搭接、152 mm 接縫，兩側各留 16 mm 允差。若改用 100 ksi 級鋼筋且保護層 40 mm（2.5d_b），ℓ_d = 12d_b = 192 mm、ℓ_s ≥ 144 mm，接縫應加寬到約 203 mm。一道 12 m 長接縫 UHPC 體積 0.152×0.2×12 ≈ 0.365 m³，含 10% 損耗約 0.40 m³，鋼纖維約 0.40×157 ≈ 63 kg。介面剪力以剪力摩擦估算：粗糙化 6 mm 約 895 kN/m，未粗糙化約 442 kN/m，差約 2 倍。驗收：流度 178 至 254 mm，抗壓達 97 MPa（14 ksi）才拆模與承受施工荷重，28 天大於 145 MPa（21 ksi）；76.2 mm 圓柱試體破壞荷重 680 kN 即約 149 MPa。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實際橋梁的設計。","textEn":"Design exercise: two full-depth precast deck panels 200 mm thick are joined by a transverse UHPC joint with projecting 16 mm bars at 150 mm (f_y = 420 MPa, below 75 ksi) and 50 mm cover (at least 3d_b = 48 mm). By the FHWA rule ℓ_d = 8d_b = 128 mm and ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm, so a 120 mm lap in a 152 mm joint leaves 16 mm tolerance each side. With 100 ksi bars and 40 mm cover (2.5d_b), ℓ_d = 12d_b = 192 mm and ℓ_s ≥ 144 mm, so the joint should widen to about 203 mm. A 12 m joint holds 0.152×0.2×12 ≈ 0.365 m³ of UHPC, about 0.40 m³ with 10% waste and about 0.40×157 ≈ 63 kg of steel fibre. Shear friction gives interface capacity of about 895 kN/m when roughened to 6 mm and about 442 kN/m unroughened, roughly a factor of 2. Acceptance: flow of 178 to 254 mm, stripping and construction loading only at 97 MPa (14 ksi), and above 145 MPa (21 ksi) at 28 days; a 76.2 mm cylinder failing at 680 kN is about 149 MPa. Values are teaching assumptions, not the design of any real bridge.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":13,"enrichmentVersion":13,"stages":[{"id":"b053-v13-s1","title":"工程背景、荷載與結構系統","titleEn":"Context, loads and structural system","description":"本階段聚焦「預鑄橋面接縫的荷載路徑」與「收縮、溫差與介面約束」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Load path through precast deck joints\" and \"Shrinkage, thermal difference and interface restraint\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b053-v13-01","title":"預鑄橋面接縫的荷載路徑：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Load path through precast deck joints: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「接縫介面彎曲應力」如何影響橋面超高性能混凝土接縫的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Joint-interface flexural stress” governs force, deformation or durability in “UHPC bridge-deck closure joints”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"快速橋梁施工把橋面拆成預鑄全深度橋面板或帶翼板的預鑄梁，在工廠製作、現場吊裝，再以現澆接縫把它們連成連續的橋面。接縫必須把車輪荷重造成的彎矩與剪力從一塊板傳到下一塊，並長期不透水；傳統做法需要寬接縫讓鋼筋長距離搭接，或以後拉預力壓緊接縫。超高性能混凝土的強度與握裹力極高，使接縫可窄到約 150 mm，鋼筋只需短距離非接觸搭接。但接縫最弱的地方往往不是 UHPC 本身，而是它與預鑄混凝土之間的介面。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「接縫介面彎曲應力」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Accelerated bridge construction splits the deck into full-depth precast panels or precast girders with integral flanges, made in a plant and lifted into place, then joined into a continuous deck with field-cast joints. The joints must pass wheel-load moments and shears from one element to the next and stay watertight for decades; conventional practice needs wide joints for long bar laps or post-tensioning to clamp the joint. UHPC's very high strength and bond allow joints only about 150 mm wide with short non-contact lap splices. Yet the weakest part of the joint is often not the UHPC itself but its interface with the precast concrete. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Joint-interface flexural stress” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：接縫處每米寬負彎矩 M = 25 kN·m/m，板厚 h = 0.2 m，斷面模數 S = b·h²/6 = 1.0×0.2²/6 ≈ 0.00667 m³，σ = M/S ≈ 3.75 MPa；此應力低於 UHPC 約 8.5 MPa 的直接拉伸開裂強度，但已接近一般混凝土與介面的開裂應力，裂縫會先出現在介面。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With a negative moment at the joint of M = 25 kN·m/m and deck thickness h = 0.2 m, the section modulus S = b·h²/6 = 1.0×0.2²/6 ≈ 0.00667 m³ and σ = M/S ≈ 3.75 MPa; this is below UHPC's direct tensile cracking strength of about 8.5 MPa but near the cracking stress of ordinary concrete and the interface, so cracks appear at the interface first.","failure":"常見誤解：「UHPC 強度極高，所以接縫處絕對不會開裂。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"UHPC is so strong that the joint can never crack.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「接縫介面彎曲應力」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Joint-interface flexural stress”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-01-k1","title":"預鑄橋面接縫的荷載路徑","titleEn":"Load path through precast deck joints","text":"快速橋梁施工把橋面拆成預鑄全深度橋面板或帶翼板的預鑄梁，在工廠製作、現場吊裝，再以現澆接縫把它們連成連續的橋面。接縫必須把車輪荷重造成的彎矩與剪力從一塊板傳到下一塊，並長期不透水；傳統做法需要寬接縫讓鋼筋長距離搭接，或以後拉預力壓緊接縫。","textEn":"Accelerated bridge construction splits the deck into full-depth precast panels or precast girders with integral flanges, made in a plant and lifted into place, then joined into a continuous deck with field-cast joints. The joints must pass wheel-load moments and shears from one element to the next and stay watertight for decades; conventional practice needs wide joints for long bar laps or post-tensioning to clamp the joint.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：UHPC 強度極高，所以接縫處絕對不會開裂。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: UHPC is so strong that the joint can never crack. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「預鑄橋面接縫的荷載路徑」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Load path through precast deck joints\" is correct?","options":["UHPC 強度極高，所以接縫處絕對不會開裂。","快速橋梁施工把橋面拆成預鑄全深度橋面板或帶翼板的預鑄梁，在工廠製作、現場吊裝，再以現澆接縫把它們連成連續的橋面。","UHPC 是無收縮材料，不需要考慮收縮與溫差。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC is so strong that the joint can never crack.","Accelerated bridge construction splits the deck into full-depth precast panels or precast girders with integral flanges, made in a plant and lifted into place, then joined into a continuous deck with field-cast joints.","UHPC is a non-shrink material, so shrinkage and temperature need not be considered."],"answer":1,"explanation":"快速橋梁施工把橋面拆成預鑄全深度橋面板或帶翼板的預鑄梁，在工廠製作、現場吊裝，再以現澆接縫把它們連成連續的橋面。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Accelerated bridge construction splits the deck into full-depth precast panels or precast girders with integral flanges, made in a plant and lifted into place, then joined into a continuous deck with field-cast joints. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b053-v13-02","title":"預鑄橋面接縫的荷載路徑：定量估算","titleEn":"Load path through precast deck joints: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「接縫介面彎曲應力」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Joint-interface flexural stress” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：接縫處每米寬負彎矩 M = 25 kN·m/m，板厚 h = 0.2 m，斷面模數 S = b·h²/6 = 1.0×0.2²/6 ≈ 0.00667 m³，σ = M/S ≈ 3.75 MPa；此應力低於 UHPC 約 8.5 MPa 的直接拉伸開裂強度，但已接近一般混凝土與介面的開裂應力，裂縫會先出現在介面。數值除 UHPC 強度外為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With a negative moment at the joint of M = 25 kN·m/m and deck thickness h = 0.2 m, the section modulus S = b·h²/6 = 1.0×0.2²/6 ≈ 0.00667 m³ and σ = M/S ≈ 3.75 MPa; this is below UHPC's direct tensile cracking strength of about 8.5 MPa but near the cracking stress of ordinary concrete and the interface, so cracks appear at the interface first. Values other than the UHPC strength are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以有限元素或格梁分析求得接縫位置在車輪荷重、溫度梯度與收縮下的彎矩與剪力，分別檢查 UHPC 本體、介面與預鑄板的應力；接縫位置盡量避開負彎矩最大處，並確認鋼筋穿越接縫的數量足以承受介面開裂後的拉力。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Use finite-element or grillage analysis to find moments and shears at the joints under wheel loads, thermal gradient and shrinkage, checking stresses in the UHPC, the interface and the precast panel separately; avoid placing joints at peak negative moment where possible and confirm that reinforcement crossing the joint can carry the tension once the interface cracks.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"接縫處每米寬負彎矩 M = 25 kN·m/m，板厚 h = 0.2 m，斷面模數 S = b·h²/6 = 1.0×0.2²/6 ≈ 0.00667 m³，σ = M/S ≈ 3.75 MPa；此應力低於 UHPC 約 8.5 MPa 的直接拉伸開裂強度，但已接近一般混凝土與介面的開裂應力，裂縫會先出現在介面。數值除 UHPC 強度外為教學假設。","textEn":"With a negative moment at the joint of M = 25 kN·m/m and deck thickness h = 0.2 m, the section modulus S = b·h²/6 = 1.0×0.2²/6 ≈ 0.00667 m³ and σ = M/S ≈ 3.75 MPa; this is below UHPC's direct tensile cracking strength of about 8.5 MPa but near the cracking stress of ordinary concrete and the interface, so cracks appear at the interface first. Values other than the UHPC strength are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「預鑄橋面接縫的荷載路徑」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Load path through precast deck joints\", which statement holds?","options":["UHPC 只是強度比較高的混凝土，配比與纖維可以由現場自行調整。","UHPC 可以像一般混凝土一樣用普通模板，漏一點漿不影響品質。","接縫處每米寬負彎矩 M = 25 kN·m/m，板厚 h = 0.2 m，斷面模數 S = b·h²/6 = 1.0×0.2²/6 ≈ 0.00667 m³，σ = M/S ≈ 3.75 MPa。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC is just stronger concrete, so mix and fibre content can be adjusted on site.","UHPC can use ordinary formwork, and a little paste leakage does not matter.","With a negative moment at the joint of M = 25 kN·m/m and deck thickness h = 0.2 m, the section modulus S = b·h²/6 = 1.0×0.2²/6 ≈ 0.00667 m³ and σ = M/S ≈ 3.75 MPa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"接縫處每米寬負彎矩 M = 25 kN·m/m，板厚 h = 0.2 m，斷面模數 S = b·h²/6 = 1.0×0.2²/6 ≈ 0.00667 m³，σ = M/S ≈ 3.75 MPa；此應力低於 UHPC 約 8.5 MPa 的直接拉伸開裂強度，但已接近一般混凝土與介面的開裂應力，裂縫會先出現在介面。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With a negative moment at the joint of M = 25 kN·m/m and deck thickness h = 0.2 m, the section modulus S = b·h²/6 = 1.0×0.2²/6 ≈ 0.00667 m³ and σ = M/S ≈ 3.75 MPa; this is below UHPC's direct tensile cracking strength of about 8.5 MPa but near the cracking stress of ordinary concrete and the interface, so cracks appear at the interface first. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b053-v13-03","title":"預鑄橋面接縫的荷載路徑：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Load path through precast deck joints: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「接縫介面彎曲應力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Joint-interface flexural stress” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以有限元素或格梁分析求得接縫位置在車輪荷重、溫度梯度與收縮下的彎矩與剪力，分別檢查 UHPC 本體、介面與預鑄板的應力；接縫位置盡量避開負彎矩最大處，並確認鋼筋穿越接縫的數量足以承受介面開裂後的拉力。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Use finite-element or grillage analysis to find moments and shears at the joints under wheel loads, thermal gradient and shrinkage, checking stresses in the UHPC, the interface and the precast panel separately; avoid placing joints at peak negative moment where possible and confirm that reinforcement crossing the joint can carry the tension once the interface cracks. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：接縫設計要分別列出 UHPC 本體、介面與相鄰預鑄板的應力檢核，並說明介面開裂後的傳力假設；接縫位置與方向在預鑄板分割時就與設計者協調，不得由施工方任意調整。","observationEn":"Site practice: Joint design lists stress checks for the UHPC, the interface and the adjacent precast panel separately and states the load-transfer assumption after interface cracking; joint location and direction are coordinated with the designer when panels are divided and may not be changed by the contractor.","failure":"注意干擾：傳統窄接縫若以一般無收縮砂漿或混凝土澆置，鋼筋搭接不足、握裹力有限，車輛反覆通過後接縫開裂、滲水，鹽水沿裂縫流到梁頂與支承，接縫成為整座橋最先劣化的部位。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Narrow joints filled with ordinary non-shrink grout or concrete have inadequate lap length and limited bond, so repeated traffic cracks them, water leaks through and de-icing brine runs onto girder tops and bearings, making the joints the first part of the bridge to deteriorate. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以有限元素或格梁分析求得接縫位置在車輪荷重、溫度梯度與收縮下的彎矩與剪力，分別檢查 UHPC 本體、介面與預鑄板的應力；接縫位置盡量避開負彎矩最大處，並確認鋼筋穿越接縫的數量足以承受介面開裂後的拉力。","textEn":"Use finite-element or grillage analysis to find moments and shears at the joints under wheel loads, thermal gradient and shrinkage, checking stresses in the UHPC, the interface and the precast panel separately; avoid placing joints at peak negative moment where possible and confirm that reinforcement crossing the joint can carry the tension once the interface cracks.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"接縫設計要分別列出 UHPC 本體、介面與相鄰預鑄板的應力檢核，並說明介面開裂後的傳力假設；接縫位置與方向在預鑄板分割時就與設計者協調，不得由施工方任意調整。","textEn":"Joint design lists stress checks for the UHPC, the interface and the adjacent precast panel separately and states the load-transfer assumption after interface cracking; joint location and direction are coordinated with the designer when panels are divided and may not be changed by the contractor.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「預鑄橋面接縫的荷載路徑」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Load path through precast deck joints\"?","options":["以有限元素或格梁分析求得接縫位置在車輪荷重、溫度梯度與收縮下的彎矩與剪力，分別檢查 UHPC 本體、介面與預鑄板的應力。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","接縫只要表面看不到裂縫，就代表不會滲水。"],"optionsEn":["Use finite-element or grillage analysis to find moments and shears at the joints under wheel loads, thermal gradient and shrinkage, checking stresses in the UHPC, the interface and the precast panel separately.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","If no crack is visible on the joint surface, it cannot leak."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以有限元素或格梁分析求得接縫位置在車輪荷重、溫度梯度與收縮下的彎矩與剪力，分別檢查 UHPC 本體、介面與預鑄板的應力；接縫位置盡量避開負彎矩最大處，並確認鋼筋穿越接縫的數量足以承受介面開裂後的拉力。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Use finite-element or grillage analysis to find moments and shears at the joints under wheel loads, thermal gradient and shrinkage, checking stresses in the UHPC, the interface and the precast panel separately; avoid placing joints at peak negative moment where possible and confirm that reinforcement crossing the joint can carry the tension once the interface cracks. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b053-v13-04","title":"預鑄橋面接縫的荷載路徑：失效診斷","titleEn":"Load path through precast deck joints: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「接縫介面彎曲應力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Joint-interface flexural stress” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"傳統窄接縫若以一般無收縮砂漿或混凝土澆置，鋼筋搭接不足、握裹力有限，車輛反覆通過後接縫開裂、滲水，鹽水沿裂縫流到梁頂與支承，接縫成為整座橋最先劣化的部位。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Narrow joints filled with ordinary non-shrink grout or concrete have inadequate lap length and limited bond, so repeated traffic cracks them, water leaks through and de-icing brine runs onto girder tops and bearings, making the joints the first part of the bridge to deteriorate. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：但接縫最弱的地方往往不是 UHPC 本身，而是它與預鑄混凝土之間的介面。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Yet the weakest part of the joint is often not the UHPC itself but its interface with the precast concrete.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「UHPC 強度極高，所以接縫處絕對不會開裂。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"UHPC is so strong that the joint can never crack.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"傳統窄接縫若以一般無收縮砂漿或混凝土澆置，鋼筋搭接不足、握裹力有限，車輛反覆通過後接縫開裂、滲水，鹽水沿裂縫流到梁頂與支承，接縫成為整座橋最先劣化的部位。","textEn":"Narrow joints filled with ordinary non-shrink grout or concrete have inadequate lap length and limited bond, so repeated traffic cracks them, water leaks through and de-icing brine runs onto girder tops and bearings, making the joints the first part of the bridge to deteriorate.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「預鑄橋面接縫的荷載路徑」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Load path through precast deck joints\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","傳統窄接縫若以一般無收縮砂漿或混凝土澆置，鋼筋搭接不足、握裹力有限，車輛反覆通過後接縫開裂、滲水，鹽水沿裂縫流到梁頂與支承，接縫成為整座橋最先劣化的部位。","UHPC 是無收縮材料，不需要考慮收縮與溫差。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Narrow joints filled with ordinary non-shrink grout or concrete have inadequate lap length and limited bond, so repeated traffic cracks them, water leaks through and de-icing brine runs onto girder tops and bearings, making the joints the first part of the bridge to deteriorate.","UHPC is a non-shrink material, so shrinkage and temperature need not be considered."],"answer":1,"explanation":"傳統窄接縫若以一般無收縮砂漿或混凝土澆置，鋼筋搭接不足、握裹力有限，車輛反覆通過後接縫開裂、滲水，鹽水沿裂縫流到梁頂與支承，接縫成為整座橋最先劣化的部位。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Narrow joints filled with ordinary non-shrink grout or concrete have inadequate lap length and limited bond, so repeated traffic cracks them, water leaks through and de-icing brine runs onto girder tops and bearings, making the joints the first part of the bridge to deteriorate. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b053-v13-05","title":"收縮、溫差與介面約束：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Shrinkage, thermal difference and interface restraint: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-04"],"objective":"說明「收縮約束應力」如何影響橋面超高性能混凝土接縫的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Restrained shrinkage stress” governs force, deformation or durability in “UHPC bridge-deck closure joints”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"UHPC 水膠比低於 0.25、膠結材含量高，自體收縮比一般混凝土大，長期收縮可達數百微應變；而相鄰的預鑄板早已完成大部分收縮，於是新澆的 UHPC 被兩側舊混凝土約束，在介面產生拉應力。水化熱也使窄接縫在初期溫度較高，冷卻時再增加收縮。若介面黏結不足，這些約束應力會讓介面在通車前就脫開，形成貫穿板厚的細縫，成為日後滲水路徑。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「收縮約束應力」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"UHPC has a water-to-cementitious ratio below 0.25 and a high binder content, so its autogenous shrinkage exceeds that of ordinary concrete and long-term shrinkage reaches several hundred microstrain; the adjacent precast panels have already completed most of their shrinkage, so the new UHPC is restrained by older concrete on both sides and tension develops at the interface. Heat of hydration also warms the narrow joint early, adding shrinkage as it cools. If bond is inadequate, these restraint stresses open the interface before traffic is even applied, forming a fine through-thickness crack that becomes a future leakage path. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Restrained shrinkage stress” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：約束收縮應力 σ = R·E·ε·k。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Restrained shrinkage stress σ = R·E·ε·k.","failure":"常見誤解：「UHPC 是無收縮材料，不需要考慮收縮與溫差。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"UHPC is a non-shrink material, so shrinkage and temperature need not be considered.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「收縮約束應力」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Restrained shrinkage stress”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-05-k1","title":"收縮、溫差與介面約束","titleEn":"Shrinkage, thermal difference and interface restraint","text":"UHPC 水膠比低於 0.25、膠結材含量高，自體收縮比一般混凝土大，長期收縮可達數百微應變；而相鄰的預鑄板早已完成大部分收縮，於是新澆的 UHPC 被兩側舊混凝土約束，在介面產生拉應力。水化熱也使窄接縫在初期溫度較高，冷卻時再增加收縮。","textEn":"UHPC has a water-to-cementitious ratio below 0.25 and a high binder content, so its autogenous shrinkage exceeds that of ordinary concrete and long-term shrinkage reaches several hundred microstrain; the adjacent precast panels have already completed most of their shrinkage, so the new UHPC is restrained by older concrete on both sides and tension develops at the interface. Heat of hydration also warms the narrow joint early, adding shrinkage as it cools.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：UHPC 是無收縮材料，不需要考慮收縮與溫差。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: UHPC is a non-shrink material, so shrinkage and temperature need not be considered. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「收縮、溫差與介面約束」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Shrinkage, thermal difference and interface restraint\" is correct?","options":["UHPC 是無收縮材料，不需要考慮收縮與溫差。","UHPC 握裹力很強，鋼筋搭接長度可以隨意縮短。","UHPC 水膠比低於 0.25、膠結材含量高，自體收縮比一般混凝土大，長期收縮可達數百微應變。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC is a non-shrink material, so shrinkage and temperature need not be considered.","UHPC bonds so well that lap length can be shortened at will.","UHPC has a water-to-cementitious ratio below 0.25 and a high binder content, so its autogenous shrinkage exceeds that of ordinary concrete and long-term shrinkage reaches several hundred microstrain."],"answer":2,"explanation":"UHPC 水膠比低於 0.25、膠結材含量高，自體收縮比一般混凝土大，長期收縮可達數百微應變；而相鄰的預鑄板早已完成大部分收縮，於是新澆的 UHPC 被兩側舊混凝土約束，在介面產生拉應力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"UHPC has a water-to-cementitious ratio below 0.25 and a high binder content, so its autogenous shrinkage exceeds that of ordinary concrete and long-term shrinkage reaches several hundred microstrain; the adjacent precast panels have already completed most of their shrinkage, so the new UHPC is restrained by older concrete on both sides and tension develops at the interface. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b053-v13-06","title":"收縮、溫差與介面約束：定量估算","titleEn":"Shrinkage, thermal difference and interface restraint: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「收縮約束應力」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Restrained shrinkage stress” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：約束收縮應力 σ = R·E·ε·k。E = 48 GPa、長期收縮 ε = 555×10⁻⁶、約束度 R = 0.3、潛變鬆弛係數 k = 0.5：σ = 0.3×48,000×555×10⁻⁶×0.5 ≈ 4.0 MPa，低於 UHPC 開裂強度約 8.5 MPa，但可能超過未粗糙化介面的黏結強度。數值除材料性質外為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Restrained shrinkage stress σ = R·E·ε·k. With E = 48 GPa, long-term shrinkage ε = 555×10⁻⁶, restraint R = 0.3 and creep relaxation factor k = 0.5: σ = 0.3×48,000×555×10⁻⁶×0.5 ≈ 4.0 MPa, below UHPC's cracking strength of about 8.5 MPa but possibly above the bond strength of an unroughened interface. Values other than material properties are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以材料試驗取得 UHPC 的收縮曲線（例如規定 28 天收縮上限），在接縫中埋設振弦式應變計與溫度計記錄初期溫度與應變；通車前以目視與噴水檢查介面是否有細縫，並在第一個冬季後再檢查一次。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Obtain the UHPC shrinkage curve from material tests (for example against a specified 28-day limit), embed vibrating-wire strain gauges and thermometers in the joint to record early temperature and strain, and check the interface for fine cracks visually and by water spray before opening and again after the first winter.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"約束收縮應力 σ = R·E·ε·k。E = 48 GPa、長期收縮 ε = 555×10⁻⁶、約束度 R = 0.3、潛變鬆弛係數 k = 0.5：σ = 0.3×48,000×555×10⁻⁶×0.5 ≈ 4.0 MPa，低於 UHPC 開裂強度約 8.5 MPa，但可能超過未粗糙化介面的黏結強度。數值除材料性質外為教學假設。","textEn":"Restrained shrinkage stress σ = R·E·ε·k. With E = 48 GPa, long-term shrinkage ε = 555×10⁻⁶, restraint R = 0.3 and creep relaxation factor k = 0.5: σ = 0.3×48,000×555×10⁻⁶×0.5 ≈ 4.0 MPa, below UHPC's cracking strength of about 8.5 MPa but possibly above the bond strength of an unroughened interface. Values other than material properties are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「收縮、溫差與介面約束」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Shrinkage, thermal difference and interface restraint\", which statement holds?","options":["約束收縮應力 σ = R·E·ε·k。","UHPC 黏結力很強，預鑄介面平滑也沒關係。","UHPC 一定很強，只要按配比拌合就不必做驗收試驗。"],"optionsEn":["Restrained shrinkage stress σ = R·E·ε·k.","UHPC bonds so strongly that a smooth precast interface does not matter.","UHPC is always strong, so batching by the recipe makes acceptance testing unnecessary."],"answer":0,"explanation":"約束收縮應力 σ = R·E·ε·k。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Restrained shrinkage stress σ = R·E·ε·k. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b053-v13-07","title":"收縮、溫差與介面約束：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Shrinkage, thermal difference and interface restraint: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「收縮約束應力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Restrained shrinkage stress” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以材料試驗取得 UHPC 的收縮曲線（例如規定 28 天收縮上限），在接縫中埋設振弦式應變計與溫度計記錄初期溫度與應變；通車前以目視與噴水檢查介面是否有細縫，並在第一個冬季後再檢查一次。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Obtain the UHPC shrinkage curve from material tests (for example against a specified 28-day limit), embed vibrating-wire strain gauges and thermometers in the joint to record early temperature and strain, and check the interface for fine cracks visually and by water spray before opening and again after the first winter. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：規格書要列出 UHPC 收縮上限、澆置時的氣溫與預鑄板表面溫度範圍、初期養護方式（封閉保濕至初凝），並禁止以熱風直吹新澆表面；接縫監測計畫在設計時就納入。","observationEn":"Site practice: The specification lists the UHPC shrinkage limit, air and panel-surface temperature ranges for casting and early curing (sealed and moist until initial set), and forbids forced hot air on fresh surfaces; joint monitoring is planned at design.","failure":"注意干擾：在高溫午後澆置窄接縫、又以強風機直吹表面加速乾燥，UHPC 表面失水並劇烈收縮，介面在數天內脫開；外觀上接縫完整，但雨水與鹽水沿介面細縫滲入，數年後下方梁頂出現鏽水與白華。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Casting a narrow joint on a hot afternoon and blowing forced air across it dries the surface and drives severe shrinkage, opening the interface within days; the joint looks intact, but rain and brine seep along the fine interface crack and rust staining and efflorescence appear on the girder tops below within a few years. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以材料試驗取得 UHPC 的收縮曲線（例如規定 28 天收縮上限），在接縫中埋設振弦式應變計與溫度計記錄初期溫度與應變；通車前以目視與噴水檢查介面是否有細縫，並在第一個冬季後再檢查一次。","textEn":"Obtain the UHPC shrinkage curve from material tests (for example against a specified 28-day limit), embed vibrating-wire strain gauges and thermometers in the joint to record early temperature and strain, and check the interface for fine cracks visually and by water spray before opening and again after the first winter.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"規格書要列出 UHPC 收縮上限、澆置時的氣溫與預鑄板表面溫度範圍、初期養護方式（封閉保濕至初凝），並禁止以熱風直吹新澆表面；接縫監測計畫在設計時就納入。","textEn":"The specification lists the UHPC shrinkage limit, air and panel-surface temperature ranges for casting and early curing (sealed and moist until initial set), and forbids forced hot air on fresh surfaces; joint monitoring is planned at design.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「收縮、溫差與介面約束」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Shrinkage, thermal difference and interface restraint\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","以材料試驗取得 UHPC 的收縮曲線（例如規定 28 天收縮上限），在接縫中埋設振弦式應變計與溫度計記錄初期溫度與應變。","UHPC 不透水，所以整條接縫及其周邊都不會發生腐蝕。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Obtain the UHPC shrinkage curve from material tests (for example against a specified 28-day limit), embed vibrating-wire strain gauges and thermometers in the joint to record early temperature and strain, and check the interface for fine cracks visually and by water spray before opening and again after the first winter.","UHPC is impermeable, so neither the joint nor its surroundings can corrode."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以材料試驗取得 UHPC 的收縮曲線（例如規定 28 天收縮上限），在接縫中埋設振弦式應變計與溫度計記錄初期溫度與應變；通車前以目視與噴水檢查介面是否有細縫，並在第一個冬季後再檢查一次。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Obtain the UHPC shrinkage curve from material tests (for example against a specified 28-day limit), embed vibrating-wire strain gauges and thermometers in the joint to record early temperature and strain, and check the interface for fine cracks visually and by water spray before opening and again after the first winter. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b053-v13-08","title":"收縮、溫差與介面約束：失效診斷","titleEn":"Shrinkage, thermal difference and interface restraint: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「收縮約束應力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Restrained shrinkage stress” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"在高溫午後澆置窄接縫、又以強風機直吹表面加速乾燥，UHPC 表面失水並劇烈收縮，介面在數天內脫開；外觀上接縫完整，但雨水與鹽水沿介面細縫滲入，數年後下方梁頂出現鏽水與白華。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Casting a narrow joint on a hot afternoon and blowing forced air across it dries the surface and drives severe shrinkage, opening the interface within days; the joint looks intact, but rain and brine seep along the fine interface crack and rust staining and efflorescence appear on the girder tops below within a few years. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：若介面黏結不足，這些約束應力會讓介面在通車前就脫開，形成貫穿板厚的細縫，成為日後滲水路徑。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: If bond is inadequate, these restraint stresses open the interface before traffic is even applied, forming a fine through-thickness crack that becomes a future leakage path.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「UHPC 是無收縮材料，不需要考慮收縮與溫差。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"UHPC is a non-shrink material, so shrinkage and temperature need not be considered.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"在高溫午後澆置窄接縫、又以強風機直吹表面加速乾燥，UHPC 表面失水並劇烈收縮，介面在數天內脫開；外觀上接縫完整，但雨水與鹽水沿介面細縫滲入，數年後下方梁頂出現鏽水與白華。","textEn":"Casting a narrow joint on a hot afternoon and blowing forced air across it dries the surface and drives severe shrinkage, opening the interface within days; the joint looks intact, but rain and brine seep along the fine interface crack and rust staining and efflorescence appear on the girder tops below within a few years.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「收縮、溫差與介面約束」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Shrinkage, thermal difference and interface restraint\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","UHPC 握裹力很強，鋼筋搭接長度可以隨意縮短。","在高溫午後澆置窄接縫、又以強風機直吹表面加速乾燥，UHPC 表面失水並劇烈收縮，介面在數天內脫開。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","UHPC bonds so well that lap length can be shortened at will.","Casting a narrow joint on a hot afternoon and blowing forced air across it dries the surface and drives severe shrinkage, opening the interface within days."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在高溫午後澆置窄接縫、又以強風機直吹表面加速乾燥，UHPC 表面失水並劇烈收縮，介面在數天內脫開；外觀上接縫完整，但雨水與鹽水沿介面細縫滲入，數年後下方梁頂出現鏽水與白華。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Casting a narrow joint on a hot afternoon and blowing forced air across it dries the surface and drives severe shrinkage, opening the interface within days; the joint looks intact, but rain and brine seep along the fine interface crack and rust staining and efflorescence appear on the girder tops below within a few years. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b053-v13-s2","title":"材料、構件與接合細部","titleEn":"Materials, members and connection details","description":"本階段聚焦「鋼筋搭接長度與接縫寬度」與「UHPC 組成與材料性質」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Lap-splice length and joint width\" and \"UHPC constituents and material properties\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b053-v13-09","title":"鋼筋搭接長度與接縫寬度：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Lap-splice length and joint width: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-08"],"objective":"說明「非接觸搭接長度 ℓ_s」如何影響橋面超高性能混凝土接縫的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Non-contact lap length ℓ_s” governs force, deformation or durability in “UHPC bridge-deck closure joints”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"接縫中的鋼筋不需要互相接觸，而是由兩側伸出的鋼筋交錯排列，拉力經由周圍 UHPC 的握裹與纖維橋接傳到另一側鋼筋。FHWA 2014 年的技術說明建議：在 2% 鋼纖維、抗壓強度至少 14 ksi、保護層至少 3 倍筋徑、鋼筋不大於 8 號且降伏強度不超過 75 ksi 時，伸展長度 ℓ_d 取 8 倍筋徑，搭接長度 ℓ_s 至少 0.75ℓ_d；鋼筋強度在 75 至 100 ksi 時取 10 倍，保護層只有 2 至 3 倍筋徑時再加 2 倍筋徑，且相鄰搭接筋的淨距不得超過 ℓ_s。接縫寬度則要在搭接長度外保留製造與安裝允差。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「非接觸搭接長度 ℓ_s」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Bars in the joint need not touch; bars projecting from each side interleave, and tension passes through bond in the surrounding UHPC and fibre bridging to the bars opposite. FHWA's 2014 TechNote recommends that, with 2% steel fibre, compressive strength of at least 14 ksi, cover of at least three bar diameters, bars no larger than No. 8 and yield strength up to 75 ksi, the development length ℓ_d be 8 bar diameters and the lap ℓ_s at least 0.75ℓ_d; bars of 75 to 100 ksi take 10 diameters, cover of only 2 to 3 diameters adds 2 diameters, and clear spacing to the nearest spliced bar may not exceed ℓ_s. Joint width must then add fabrication and erection tolerance to the lap length. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Non-contact lap length ℓ_s” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：16 mm 鋼筋、f_y ≤ 75 ksi、保護層 ≥ 3d_b：ℓ_d = 8×16 = 128 mm，ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For 16 mm bars with f_y ≤ 75 ksi and cover ≥ 3d_b: ℓ_d = 8×16 = 128 mm and ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm.","failure":"常見誤解：「UHPC 握裹力很強，鋼筋搭接長度可以隨意縮短。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"UHPC bonds so well that lap length can be shortened at will.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「非接觸搭接長度 ℓ_s」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Non-contact lap length ℓ_s”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-09-k1","title":"鋼筋搭接長度與接縫寬度","titleEn":"Lap-splice length and joint width","text":"接縫中的鋼筋不需要互相接觸，而是由兩側伸出的鋼筋交錯排列，拉力經由周圍 UHPC 的握裹與纖維橋接傳到另一側鋼筋。FHWA 2014 年的技術說明建議：在 2% 鋼纖維、抗壓強度至少 14 ksi、保護層至少 3 倍筋徑、鋼筋不大於 8 號且降伏強度不超過 75 ksi 時，伸展長度 ℓ_d 取 8 倍筋徑，搭接長度 ℓ_s 至少 0.75ℓ_d；鋼筋強度在 75 至 100 ksi 時取 10 倍，保護層只有 2 至 3 倍筋徑時再加 2 倍筋徑，且相鄰搭接筋的淨距不得超過 ℓ_s。","textEn":"Bars in the joint need not touch; bars projecting from each side interleave, and tension passes through bond in the surrounding UHPC and fibre bridging to the bars opposite. FHWA's 2014 TechNote recommends that, with 2% steel fibre, compressive strength of at least 14 ksi, cover of at least three bar diameters, bars no larger than No. 8 and yield strength up to 75 ksi, the development length ℓ_d be 8 bar diameters and the lap ℓ_s at least 0.75ℓ_d; bars of 75 to 100 ksi take 10 diameters, cover of only 2 to 3 diameters adds 2 diameters, and clear spacing to the nearest spliced bar may not exceed ℓ_s.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：UHPC 握裹力很強，鋼筋搭接長度可以隨意縮短。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: UHPC bonds so well that lap length can be shortened at will. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「鋼筋搭接長度與接縫寬度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Lap-splice length and joint width\" is correct?","options":["接縫中的鋼筋不需要互相接觸，而是由兩側伸出的鋼筋交錯排列，拉力經由周圍 UHPC 的握裹與纖維橋接傳到另一側鋼筋。","UHPC 握裹力很強，鋼筋搭接長度可以隨意縮短。","UHPC 只是強度比較高的混凝土，配比與纖維可以由現場自行調整。"],"optionsEn":["Bars in the joint need not touch.","UHPC bonds so well that lap length can be shortened at will.","UHPC is just stronger concrete, so mix and fibre content can be adjusted on site."],"answer":0,"explanation":"接縫中的鋼筋不需要互相接觸，而是由兩側伸出的鋼筋交錯排列，拉力經由周圍 UHPC 的握裹與纖維橋接傳到另一側鋼筋。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Bars in the joint need not touch; bars projecting from each side interleave, and tension passes through bond in the surrounding UHPC and fibre bridging to the bars opposite. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b053-v13-10","title":"鋼筋搭接長度與接縫寬度：定量估算","titleEn":"Lap-splice length and joint width: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「非接觸搭接長度 ℓ_s」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Non-contact lap length ℓ_s” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：16 mm 鋼筋、f_y ≤ 75 ksi、保護層 ≥ 3d_b：ℓ_d = 8×16 = 128 mm，ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm。若改用 100 ksi 級鋼筋且保護層僅 2.5d_b：ℓ_d = (10 + 2)×16 = 192 mm，ℓ_s ≥ 144 mm，152 mm 接縫幾乎沒有允差，宜加寬到約 203 mm。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For 16 mm bars with f_y ≤ 75 ksi and cover ≥ 3d_b: ℓ_d = 8×16 = 128 mm and ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm. With 100 ksi bars and only 2.5d_b cover: ℓ_d = (10 + 2)×16 = 192 mm and ℓ_s ≥ 144 mm, leaving a 152 mm joint almost no tolerance, so widen it to about 203 mm. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：預鑄廠檢查伸出鋼筋的長度、間距、保護層與位置，製作接縫配筋的實尺寸樣板，在吊裝前試套確認兩側鋼筋交錯不衝突；吊裝後量測實際搭接長度與淨距，記錄在每一道接縫的查驗表中。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: At the precast plant check projecting bar length, spacing, cover and position, make a full-size template of the joint reinforcement and trial-fit it before erection to confirm the interleaving bars do not clash; after erection measure actual lap length and clear spacing, recording them on each joint's inspection sheet.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"16 mm 鋼筋、f_y ≤ 75 ksi、保護層 ≥ 3d_b：ℓ_d = 8×16 = 128 mm，ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm。若改用 100 ksi 級鋼筋且保護層僅 2.5d_b：ℓ_d = (10 + 2)×16 = 192 mm，ℓ_s ≥ 144 mm，152 mm 接縫幾乎沒有允差，宜加寬到約 203 mm。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"For 16 mm bars with f_y ≤ 75 ksi and cover ≥ 3d_b: ℓ_d = 8×16 = 128 mm and ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm. With 100 ksi bars and only 2.5d_b cover: ℓ_d = (10 + 2)×16 = 192 mm and ℓ_s ≥ 144 mm, leaving a 152 mm joint almost no tolerance, so widen it to about 203 mm. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「鋼筋搭接長度與接縫寬度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Lap-splice length and joint width\", which statement holds?","options":["UHPC 可以像一般混凝土一樣用普通模板，漏一點漿不影響品質。","16 mm 鋼筋、f_y ≤ 75 ksi、保護層 ≥ 3d_b：ℓ_d = 8×16 = 128 mm，ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm。","接縫只要表面看不到裂縫，就代表不會滲水。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC can use ordinary formwork, and a little paste leakage does not matter.","For 16 mm bars with f_y ≤ 75 ksi and cover ≥ 3d_b: ℓ_d = 8×16 = 128 mm and ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm.","If no crack is visible on the joint surface, it cannot leak."],"answer":1,"explanation":"16 mm 鋼筋、f_y ≤ 75 ksi、保護層 ≥ 3d_b：ℓ_d = 8×16 = 128 mm，ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For 16 mm bars with f_y ≤ 75 ksi and cover ≥ 3d_b: ℓ_d = 8×16 = 128 mm and ℓ_s ≥ 0.75×128 = 96 mm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b053-v13-11","title":"鋼筋搭接長度與接縫寬度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Lap-splice length and joint width: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「非接觸搭接長度 ℓ_s」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Non-contact lap length ℓ_s” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"預鑄廠檢查伸出鋼筋的長度、間距、保護層與位置，製作接縫配筋的實尺寸樣板，在吊裝前試套確認兩側鋼筋交錯不衝突；吊裝後量測實際搭接長度與淨距，記錄在每一道接縫的查驗表中。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"At the precast plant check projecting bar length, spacing, cover and position, make a full-size template of the joint reinforcement and trial-fit it before erection to confirm the interleaving bars do not clash; after erection measure actual lap length and clear spacing, recording them on each joint's inspection sheet. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：伸出筋的位置允差、接縫寬度與最小搭接長度要寫在預鑄板製造圖上，鋼筋切割或彎折一律須經設計者書面同意；紐約州 CR47 案例即把接縫做成 8 吋寬，比 6 吋搭接多留 2 吋現場允差。","observationEn":"Site practice: Projecting-bar tolerances, joint width and minimum lap length go on the panel shop drawings, and any cutting or bending of bars needs the designer's written approval; New York's CR47 project made its joint 8 inches wide, leaving 2 inches of field tolerance beyond a 6 inch lap.","failure":"注意干擾：預鑄板伸出筋位置偏差，吊裝時兩側鋼筋互相頂住，現場把鋼筋彎折或切短以便就位，實際搭接長度低於要求；或接縫寬度剛好等於搭接長度，任何吊裝偏差都讓搭接不足。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Projecting bars out of position clash during erection, and site crews bend or cut them to make the panels fit, leaving laps below the requirement; or a joint exactly as wide as the lap length means any erection deviation produces an inadequate lap. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"預鑄廠檢查伸出鋼筋的長度、間距、保護層與位置，製作接縫配筋的實尺寸樣板，在吊裝前試套確認兩側鋼筋交錯不衝突；吊裝後量測實際搭接長度與淨距，記錄在每一道接縫的查驗表中。","textEn":"At the precast plant check projecting bar length, spacing, cover and position, make a full-size template of the joint reinforcement and trial-fit it before erection to confirm the interleaving bars do not clash; after erection measure actual lap length and clear spacing, recording them on each joint's inspection sheet.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"伸出筋的位置允差、接縫寬度與最小搭接長度要寫在預鑄板製造圖上，鋼筋切割或彎折一律須經設計者書面同意；紐約州 CR47 案例即把接縫做成 8 吋寬，比 6 吋搭接多留 2 吋現場允差。","textEn":"Projecting-bar tolerances, joint width and minimum lap length go on the panel shop drawings, and any cutting or bending of bars needs the designer's written approval; New York's CR47 project made its joint 8 inches wide, leaving 2 inches of field tolerance beyond a 6 inch lap.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「鋼筋搭接長度與接縫寬度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Lap-splice length and joint width\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","UHPC 接縫耐久性極高，交接後就不需要任何紀錄或維修規劃。","預鑄廠檢查伸出鋼筋的長度、間距、保護層與位置，製作接縫配筋的實尺寸樣板，在吊裝前試套確認兩側鋼筋交錯不衝突。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","UHPC joints are so durable that no records or repair planning are needed after handover.","At the precast plant check projecting bar length, spacing, cover and position, make a full-size template of the joint reinforcement and trial-fit it before erection to confirm the interleaving bars do not clash."],"answer":2,"explanation":"預鑄廠檢查伸出鋼筋的長度、間距、保護層與位置，製作接縫配筋的實尺寸樣板，在吊裝前試套確認兩側鋼筋交錯不衝突；吊裝後量測實際搭接長度與淨距，記錄在每一道接縫的查驗表中。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"At the precast plant check projecting bar length, spacing, cover and position, make a full-size template of the joint reinforcement and trial-fit it before erection to confirm the interleaving bars do not clash; after erection measure actual lap length and clear spacing, recording them on each joint's inspection sheet. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b053-v13-12","title":"鋼筋搭接長度與接縫寬度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Lap-splice length and joint width: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「非接觸搭接長度 ℓ_s」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Non-contact lap length ℓ_s” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"預鑄板伸出筋位置偏差，吊裝時兩側鋼筋互相頂住，現場把鋼筋彎折或切短以便就位，實際搭接長度低於要求；或接縫寬度剛好等於搭接長度，任何吊裝偏差都讓搭接不足。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Projecting bars out of position clash during erection, and site crews bend or cut them to make the panels fit, leaving laps below the requirement; or a joint exactly as wide as the lap length means any erection deviation produces an inadequate lap. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：接縫寬度則要在搭接長度外保留製造與安裝允差。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Joint width must then add fabrication and erection tolerance to the lap length.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「UHPC 握裹力很強，鋼筋搭接長度可以隨意縮短。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"UHPC bonds so well that lap length can be shortened at will.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"預鑄板伸出筋位置偏差，吊裝時兩側鋼筋互相頂住，現場把鋼筋彎折或切短以便就位，實際搭接長度低於要求；或接縫寬度剛好等於搭接長度，任何吊裝偏差都讓搭接不足。","textEn":"Projecting bars out of position clash during erection, and site crews bend or cut them to make the panels fit, leaving laps below the requirement; or a joint exactly as wide as the lap length means any erection deviation produces an inadequate lap.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「鋼筋搭接長度與接縫寬度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Lap-splice length and joint width\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["預鑄板伸出筋位置偏差，吊裝時兩側鋼筋互相頂住，現場把鋼筋彎折或切短以便就位，實際搭接長度低於要求；或接縫寬度剛好等於搭接長度，任何吊裝偏差都讓搭接不足。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","UHPC 只是強度比較高的混凝土，配比與纖維可以由現場自行調整。"],"optionsEn":["Projecting bars out of position clash during erection, and site crews bend or cut them to make the panels fit, leaving laps below the requirement.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","UHPC is just stronger concrete, so mix and fibre content can be adjusted on site."],"answer":0,"explanation":"預鑄板伸出筋位置偏差，吊裝時兩側鋼筋互相頂住，現場把鋼筋彎折或切短以便就位，實際搭接長度低於要求；或接縫寬度剛好等於搭接長度，任何吊裝偏差都讓搭接不足。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Projecting bars out of position clash during erection, and site crews bend or cut them to make the panels fit, leaving laps below the requirement; or a joint exactly as wide as the lap length means any erection deviation produces an inadequate lap. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b053-v13-13","title":"UHPC 組成與材料性質：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"UHPC constituents and material properties: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-12"],"objective":"說明「2% 鋼纖維」如何影響橋面超高性能混凝土接縫的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “2% steel fibre” governs force, deformation or durability in “UHPC bridge-deck closure joints”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"UHPC 以級配最佳化的細顆粒（水泥、矽灰、細砂與填料）、低於 0.25 的水膠比、高效減水劑與大量短鋼纖維組成，不含粗骨材。緻密的基材使抗壓強度超過 150 MPa、氯離子滲透極低；鋼纖維在開裂後跨越裂縫持續傳遞拉力，使材料具有超過 5 MPa 的持續開裂後拉力強度，這也是短搭接成立的關鍵。FHWA 的現澆 UHPC 試驗數據顯示 28 天抗壓強度平均約 165 MPa、直接拉伸開裂強度約 8.5 MPa、彈性模數約 48 GPa。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「2% 鋼纖維」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"UHPC combines optimally graded fine particles (cement, silica fume, fine sand and fillers), a water-to-cementitious ratio below 0.25, high-range water reducer and a large dose of short steel fibres, with no coarse aggregate. The dense matrix gives compressive strength above 150 MPa and very low chloride penetrability; the fibres keep carrying tension across cracks after cracking, giving a sustained post-cracking tensile strength above 5 MPa, which is what makes short laps work. FHWA data for field-cast UHPC show an average 28-day compressive strength of about 165 MPa, direct tensile cracking strength of about 8.5 MPa and an elastic modulus of about 48 GPa. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “2% steel fibre” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：纖維體積率 2%，單根纖維直徑 0.2 mm、長 13 mm，體積 π/4×0.0002²×0.013 ≈ 4.08×10⁻¹⁰ m³；每 m³ 約 0.02/4.08×10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 4.9×10⁷ 根，鋼纖維重 0.02×7,850 ≈ 157 kg。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: At 2% by volume, a fibre 0.2 mm in diameter and 13 mm long has a volume of π/4×0.0002²×0.013 ≈ 4.08×10⁻¹⁰ m³, so 1 m³ holds about 0.02/4.08×10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 4.9×10⁷ fibres weighing 0.02×7,850 ≈ 157 kg.","failure":"常見誤解：「UHPC 只是強度比較高的混凝土，配比與纖維可以由現場自行調整。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"UHPC is just stronger concrete, so mix and fibre content can be adjusted on site.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「2% 鋼纖維」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “2% steel fibre”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-13-k1","title":"UHPC 組成與材料性質","titleEn":"UHPC constituents and material properties","text":"UHPC 以級配最佳化的細顆粒（水泥、矽灰、細砂與填料）、低於 0.25 的水膠比、高效減水劑與大量短鋼纖維組成，不含粗骨材。緻密的基材使抗壓強度超過 150 MPa、氯離子滲透極低；鋼纖維在開裂後跨越裂縫持續傳遞拉力，使材料具有超過 5 MPa 的持續開裂後拉力強度，這也是短搭接成立的關鍵。","textEn":"UHPC combines optimally graded fine particles (cement, silica fume, fine sand and fillers), a water-to-cementitious ratio below 0.25, high-range water reducer and a large dose of short steel fibres, with no coarse aggregate. The dense matrix gives compressive strength above 150 MPa and very low chloride penetrability; the fibres keep carrying tension across cracks after cracking, giving a sustained post-cracking tensile strength above 5 MPa, which is what makes short laps work.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：UHPC 只是強度比較高的混凝土，配比與纖維可以由現場自行調整。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: UHPC is just stronger concrete, so mix and fibre content can be adjusted on site. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「UHPC 組成與材料性質」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"UHPC constituents and material properties\" is correct?","options":["UHPC 只是強度比較高的混凝土，配比與纖維可以由現場自行調整。","UHPC 以級配最佳化的細顆粒（水泥、矽灰、細砂與填料）、低於 0.25 的水膠比、高效減水劑與大量短鋼纖維組成，不含粗骨材。","UHPC 黏結力很強，預鑄介面平滑也沒關係。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC is just stronger concrete, so mix and fibre content can be adjusted on site.","UHPC combines optimally graded fine particles (cement, silica fume, fine sand and fillers), a water-to-cementitious ratio below 0.25, high-range water reducer and a large dose of short steel fibres, with no coarse aggregate.","UHPC bonds so strongly that a smooth precast interface does not matter."],"answer":1,"explanation":"UHPC 以級配最佳化的細顆粒（水泥、矽灰、細砂與填料）、低於 0.25 的水膠比、高效減水劑與大量短鋼纖維組成，不含粗骨材。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"UHPC combines optimally graded fine particles (cement, silica fume, fine sand and fillers), a water-to-cementitious ratio below 0.25, high-range water reducer and a large dose of short steel fibres, with no coarse aggregate. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b053-v13-14","title":"UHPC 組成與材料性質：定量估算","titleEn":"UHPC constituents and material properties: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「2% 鋼纖維」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “2% steel fibre” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：纖維體積率 2%，單根纖維直徑 0.2 mm、長 13 mm，體積 π/4×0.0002²×0.013 ≈ 4.08×10⁻¹⁰ m³；每 m³ 約 0.02/4.08×10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 4.9×10⁷ 根，鋼纖維重 0.02×7,850 ≈ 157 kg。以 E = 1,550√f′_c（ksi）估算，f′_c = 24 ksi 時 E ≈ 7,600 ksi（約 52 GPa）。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: At 2% by volume, a fibre 0.2 mm in diameter and 13 mm long has a volume of π/4×0.0002²×0.013 ≈ 4.08×10⁻¹⁰ m³, so 1 m³ holds about 0.02/4.08×10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 4.9×10⁷ fibres weighing 0.02×7,850 ≈ 157 kg. Estimating E = 1,550√f′_c (ksi), f′_c = 24 ksi gives E ≈ 7,600 ksi (about 52 GPa). Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：材料送審時審查配比、纖維規格（直徑、長度、抗拉強度至少 2,000 MPa）、抗壓、開裂與開裂後拉力、氯離子滲透、凍融與收縮試驗報告；現場預拌包裝與纖維批號須與送審一致，並保留出廠證明。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: At submittal review the mix, fibre specification (diameter, length and tensile strength of at least 2,000 MPa), and reports on compressive, cracking and post-cracking tensile strength, chloride penetrability, freeze–thaw and shrinkage; site pre-blended bags and fibre batches must match the submittal, with mill certificates kept.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"纖維體積率 2%，單根纖維直徑 0.2 mm、長 13 mm，體積 π/4×0.0002²×0.013 ≈ 4.08×10⁻¹⁰ m³；每 m³ 約 0.02/4.08×10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 4.9×10⁷ 根，鋼纖維重 0.02×7,850 ≈ 157 kg。以 E = 1,550√f′_c（ksi）估算，f′_c = 24 ksi 時 E ≈ 7,600 ksi（約 52 GPa）。","textEn":"At 2% by volume, a fibre 0.2 mm in diameter and 13 mm long has a volume of π/4×0.0002²×0.013 ≈ 4.08×10⁻¹⁰ m³, so 1 m³ holds about 0.02/4.08×10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 4.9×10⁷ fibres weighing 0.02×7,850 ≈ 157 kg. Estimating E = 1,550√f′_c (ksi), f′_c = 24 ksi gives E ≈ 7,600 ksi (about 52 GPa).","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「UHPC 組成與材料性質」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"UHPC constituents and material properties\", which statement holds?","options":["UHPC 一定很強，只要按配比拌合就不必做驗收試驗。","UHPC 不透水，所以整條接縫及其周邊都不會發生腐蝕。","纖維體積率 2%，單根纖維直徑 0.2 mm、長 13 mm，體積 π/4×0.0002²×0.013 ≈ 4.08×10⁻¹⁰ m³。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC is always strong, so batching by the recipe makes acceptance testing unnecessary.","UHPC is impermeable, so neither the joint nor its surroundings can corrode.","At 2% by volume, a fibre 0.2 mm in diameter and 13 mm long has a volume of π/4×0.0002²×0.013 ≈ 4.08×10⁻¹⁰ m³, so 1 m³ holds about 0.02/4.08×10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 4.9×10⁷ fibres weighing 0.02×7,850 ≈ 157 kg."],"answer":2,"explanation":"纖維體積率 2%，單根纖維直徑 0.2 mm、長 13 mm，體積 π/4×0.0002²×0.013 ≈ 4.08×10⁻¹⁰ m³；每 m³ 約 0.02/4.08×10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 4.9×10⁷ 根，鋼纖維重 0.02×7,850 ≈ 157 kg。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"At 2% by volume, a fibre 0.2 mm in diameter and 13 mm long has a volume of π/4×0.0002²×0.013 ≈ 4.08×10⁻¹⁰ m³, so 1 m³ holds about 0.02/4.08×10⁻¹⁰ ≈ 4.9×10⁷ fibres weighing 0.02×7,850 ≈ 157 kg. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b053-v13-15","title":"UHPC 組成與材料性質：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"UHPC constituents and material properties: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「2% 鋼纖維」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “2% steel fibre” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"材料送審時審查配比、纖維規格（直徑、長度、抗拉強度至少 2,000 MPa）、抗壓、開裂與開裂後拉力、氯離子滲透、凍融與收縮試驗報告；現場預拌包裝與纖維批號須與送審一致，並保留出廠證明。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"At submittal review the mix, fibre specification (diameter, length and tensile strength of at least 2,000 MPa), and reports on compressive, cracking and post-cracking tensile strength, chloride penetrability, freeze–thaw and shrinkage; site pre-blended bags and fibre batches must match the submittal, with mill certificates kept. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：採用的 UHPC 產品要有完整的材料試驗與工程使用紀錄，替代產品須重新提出全部試驗資料並經設計者核可；拌合機型式、拌合時間與纖維投入順序依供應商程序並寫入施工計畫。","observationEn":"Site practice: The chosen UHPC product must have full material test data and a field record; any substitute needs a complete new test submittal and designer approval, and mixer type, mixing time and fibre addition sequence follow the supplier's procedure in the method statement.","failure":"注意干擾：現場以一般混凝土的拌合方式與時間處理 UHPC，纖維結團、分布不均，局部缺纖維區在開裂後失去拉力傳遞；或以較低纖維量的替代產品施作，搭接長度原本依 2% 纖維推導的前提就不成立。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Mixing UHPC with ordinary concrete equipment and times causes fibre balling and uneven distribution, so fibre-starved zones lose tensile transfer after cracking; substituting a product with less fibre invalidates the lap lengths derived for 2% fibre. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"材料送審時審查配比、纖維規格（直徑、長度、抗拉強度至少 2,000 MPa）、抗壓、開裂與開裂後拉力、氯離子滲透、凍融與收縮試驗報告；現場預拌包裝與纖維批號須與送審一致，並保留出廠證明。","textEn":"At submittal review the mix, fibre specification (diameter, length and tensile strength of at least 2,000 MPa), and reports on compressive, cracking and post-cracking tensile strength, chloride penetrability, freeze–thaw and shrinkage; site pre-blended bags and fibre batches must match the submittal, with mill certificates kept.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"採用的 UHPC 產品要有完整的材料試驗與工程使用紀錄，替代產品須重新提出全部試驗資料並經設計者核可；拌合機型式、拌合時間與纖維投入順序依供應商程序並寫入施工計畫。","textEn":"The chosen UHPC product must have full material test data and a field record; any substitute needs a complete new test submittal and designer approval, and mixer type, mixing time and fibre addition sequence follow the supplier's procedure in the method statement.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「UHPC 組成與材料性質」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"UHPC constituents and material properties\"?","options":["材料送審時審查配比、纖維規格（直徑、長度、抗拉強度至少 2,000 MPa）、抗壓、開裂與開裂後拉力、氯離子滲透、凍融與收縮試驗報告。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","UHPC 強度極高，所以接縫處絕對不會開裂。"],"optionsEn":["At submittal review the mix, fibre specification (diameter, length and tensile strength of at least 2,000 MPa), and reports on compressive, cracking and post-cracking tensile strength, chloride penetrability, freeze–thaw and shrinkage.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","UHPC is so strong that the joint can never crack."],"answer":0,"explanation":"材料送審時審查配比、纖維規格（直徑、長度、抗拉強度至少 2,000 MPa）、抗壓、開裂與開裂後拉力、氯離子滲透、凍融與收縮試驗報告；現場預拌包裝與纖維批號須與送審一致，並保留出廠證明。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"At submittal review the mix, fibre specification (diameter, length and tensile strength of at least 2,000 MPa), and reports on compressive, cracking and post-cracking tensile strength, chloride penetrability, freeze–thaw and shrinkage; site pre-blended bags and fibre batches must match the submittal, with mill certificates kept. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b053-v13-16","title":"UHPC 組成與材料性質：失效診斷","titleEn":"UHPC constituents and material properties: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「2% 鋼纖維」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “2% steel fibre” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"現場以一般混凝土的拌合方式與時間處理 UHPC，纖維結團、分布不均，局部缺纖維區在開裂後失去拉力傳遞；或以較低纖維量的替代產品施作，搭接長度原本依 2% 纖維推導的前提就不成立。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Mixing UHPC with ordinary concrete equipment and times causes fibre balling and uneven distribution, so fibre-starved zones lose tensile transfer after cracking; substituting a product with less fibre invalidates the lap lengths derived for 2% fibre. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：FHWA 的現澆 UHPC 試驗數據顯示 28 天抗壓強度平均約 165 MPa、直接拉伸開裂強度約 8.5 MPa、彈性模數約 48 GPa。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: FHWA data for field-cast UHPC show an average 28-day compressive strength of about 165 MPa, direct tensile cracking strength of about 8.5 MPa and an elastic modulus of about 48 GPa.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「UHPC 只是強度比較高的混凝土，配比與纖維可以由現場自行調整。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"UHPC is just stronger concrete, so mix and fibre content can be adjusted on site.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"現場以一般混凝土的拌合方式與時間處理 UHPC，纖維結團、分布不均，局部缺纖維區在開裂後失去拉力傳遞；或以較低纖維量的替代產品施作，搭接長度原本依 2% 纖維推導的前提就不成立。","textEn":"Mixing UHPC with ordinary concrete equipment and times causes fibre balling and uneven distribution, so fibre-starved zones lose tensile transfer after cracking; substituting a product with less fibre invalidates the lap lengths derived for 2% fibre.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「UHPC 組成與材料性質」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"UHPC constituents and material properties\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","現場以一般混凝土的拌合方式與時間處理 UHPC，纖維結團、分布不均，局部缺纖維區在開裂後失去拉力傳遞。","UHPC 黏結力很強，預鑄介面平滑也沒關係。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Mixing UHPC with ordinary concrete equipment and times causes fibre balling and uneven distribution, so fibre-starved zones lose tensile transfer after cracking.","UHPC bonds so strongly that a smooth precast interface does not matter."],"answer":1,"explanation":"現場以一般混凝土的拌合方式與時間處理 UHPC，纖維結團、分布不均，局部缺纖維區在開裂後失去拉力傳遞；或以較低纖維量的替代產品施作，搭接長度原本依 2% 纖維推導的前提就不成立。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Mixing UHPC with ordinary concrete equipment and times causes fibre balling and uneven distribution, so fibre-starved zones lose tensile transfer after cracking; substituting a product with less fibre invalidates the lap lengths derived for 2% fibre. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b053-v13-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「預鑄面處理與介面剪力」與「模板、澆置、溢流與養護」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Precast surface preparation and interface shear\" and \"Formwork, placement, overfill and curing\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b053-v13-17","title":"預鑄面處理與介面剪力：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Precast surface preparation and interface shear: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-16"],"objective":"說明「介面粗糙化與 SSD」如何影響橋面超高性能混凝土接縫的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Interface roughening and SSD” governs force, deformation or durability in “UHPC bridge-deck closure joints”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"UHPC 與預鑄混凝土之間的黏結決定接縫能否不開裂、不滲水。FHWA 的研究顯示，外露骨材面黏結最好，噴砂面次之，原模板面最差；建議預鑄介面粗糙化到約 6.4 mm 的凹凸幅度，最常用的方法是在預鑄時於模板塗緩凝劑、脫模後沖洗露出骨材。澆置前預鑄面要預濕到飽和面乾（SSD），避免乾燥的舊混凝土吸走 UHPC 介面的水分，但表面不得有積水。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「介面粗糙化與 SSD」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Bond between UHPC and precast concrete decides whether the joint stays uncracked and watertight. FHWA research shows exposed-aggregate surfaces bond best, sandblasted surfaces next and as-cast form faces worst, and recommends roughening precast interfaces to an amplitude of about 6.4 mm, most often by applying retarder to the form at casting and washing the surface after stripping to expose aggregate. Before placement the precast face is prewetted to saturated surface-dry (SSD) so dry old concrete does not draw water from the UHPC at the interface, but no standing water may remain. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Interface roughening and SSD” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以剪力摩擦概念 V = c·A_cv + μ·A_vf·f_y 估算每米接縫介面剪力能力：板厚 0.2 m、16 mm 筋@150 mm（A_vf ≈ 1,340 mm²/m、f_y = 420 MPa）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Estimate interface shear capacity per metre of joint with shear friction V = c·A_cv + μ·A_vf·f_y: deck 0.2 m thick with 16 mm bars at 150 mm (A_vf ≈ 1,340 mm²/m, f_y = 420 MPa).","failure":"常見誤解：「UHPC 黏結力很強，預鑄介面平滑也沒關係。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"UHPC bonds so strongly that a smooth precast interface does not matter.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「介面粗糙化與 SSD」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Interface roughening and SSD”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-17-k1","title":"預鑄面處理與介面剪力","titleEn":"Precast surface preparation and interface shear","text":"UHPC 與預鑄混凝土之間的黏結決定接縫能否不開裂、不滲水。FHWA 的研究顯示，外露骨材面黏結最好，噴砂面次之，原模板面最差；建議預鑄介面粗糙化到約 6.4 mm 的凹凸幅度，最常用的方法是在預鑄時於模板塗緩凝劑、脫模後沖洗露出骨材。","textEn":"Bond between UHPC and precast concrete decides whether the joint stays uncracked and watertight. FHWA research shows exposed-aggregate surfaces bond best, sandblasted surfaces next and as-cast form faces worst, and recommends roughening precast interfaces to an amplitude of about 6.4 mm, most often by applying retarder to the form at casting and washing the surface after stripping to expose aggregate.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：UHPC 黏結力很強，預鑄介面平滑也沒關係。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: UHPC bonds so strongly that a smooth precast interface does not matter. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「預鑄面處理與介面剪力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Precast surface preparation and interface shear\" is correct?","options":["UHPC 黏結力很強，預鑄介面平滑也沒關係。","UHPC 可以像一般混凝土一樣用普通模板，漏一點漿不影響品質。","UHPC 與預鑄混凝土之間的黏結決定接縫能否不開裂、不滲水。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC bonds so strongly that a smooth precast interface does not matter.","UHPC can use ordinary formwork, and a little paste leakage does not matter.","Bond between UHPC and precast concrete decides whether the joint stays uncracked and watertight."],"answer":2,"explanation":"UHPC 與預鑄混凝土之間的黏結決定接縫能否不開裂、不滲水。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Bond between UHPC and precast concrete decides whether the joint stays uncracked and watertight. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b053-v13-18","title":"預鑄面處理與介面剪力：定量估算","titleEn":"Precast surface preparation and interface shear: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「介面粗糙化與 SSD」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Interface roughening and SSD” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以剪力摩擦概念 V = c·A_cv + μ·A_vf·f_y 估算每米接縫介面剪力能力：板厚 0.2 m、16 mm 筋@150 mm（A_vf ≈ 1,340 mm²/m、f_y = 420 MPa）。粗糙化 6 mm 取 c = 1.66 MPa、μ = 1.0，V ≈ 332 + 563 ≈ 895 kN/m；未粗糙化取 c = 0.52 MPa、μ = 0.6，V ≈ 104 + 338 ≈ 442 kN/m。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Estimate interface shear capacity per metre of joint with shear friction V = c·A_cv + μ·A_vf·f_y: deck 0.2 m thick with 16 mm bars at 150 mm (A_vf ≈ 1,340 mm²/m, f_y = 420 MPa). Roughened to 6 mm, c = 1.66 MPa and μ = 1.0 give V ≈ 332 + 563 ≈ 895 kN/m; unroughened, c = 0.52 MPa and μ = 0.6 give V ≈ 104 + 338 ≈ 442 kN/m. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：預鑄廠以量規或砂填法量測介面粗糙幅度，拍照記錄每塊板的介面；吊裝後、澆置前清除灰塵油污，以噴水預濕並在澆置前確認達到 SSD 且無積水，由監造簽認後才可澆置。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: At the plant measure interface roughness amplitude by gauge or sand-patch method and photograph every panel's interface; after erection and before casting remove dust and oil, prewet by spraying and confirm SSD with no standing water just before placement, with the inspector signing off before casting.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以剪力摩擦概念 V = c·A_cv + μ·A_vf·f_y 估算每米接縫介面剪力能力：板厚 0.2 m、16 mm 筋@150 mm（A_vf ≈ 1,340 mm²/m、f_y = 420 MPa）。粗糙化 6 mm 取 c = 1.66 MPa、μ = 1.0，V ≈ 332 + 563 ≈ 895 kN/m；未粗糙化取 c = 0.52 MPa、μ = 0.6，V ≈ 104 + 338 ≈ 442 kN/m。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Estimate interface shear capacity per metre of joint with shear friction V = c·A_cv + μ·A_vf·f_y: deck 0.2 m thick with 16 mm bars at 150 mm (A_vf ≈ 1,340 mm²/m, f_y = 420 MPa). Roughened to 6 mm, c = 1.66 MPa and μ = 1.0 give V ≈ 332 + 563 ≈ 895 kN/m; unroughened, c = 0.52 MPa and μ = 0.6 give V ≈ 104 + 338 ≈ 442 kN/m. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「預鑄面處理與介面剪力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Precast surface preparation and interface shear\", which statement holds?","options":["以剪力摩擦概念 V = c·A_cv + μ·A_vf·f_y 估算每米接縫介面剪力能力：板厚 0.2 m、16 mm 筋@150 mm（A_vf ≈ 1,340 mm²/m、f_y = 420 MPa）。","接縫只要表面看不到裂縫，就代表不會滲水。","UHPC 接縫耐久性極高，交接後就不需要任何紀錄或維修規劃。"],"optionsEn":["Estimate interface shear capacity per metre of joint with shear friction V = c·A_cv + μ·A_vf·f_y: deck 0.2 m thick with 16 mm bars at 150 mm (A_vf ≈ 1,340 mm²/m, f_y = 420 MPa).","If no crack is visible on the joint surface, it cannot leak.","UHPC joints are so durable that no records or repair planning are needed after handover."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以剪力摩擦概念 V = c·A_cv + μ·A_vf·f_y 估算每米接縫介面剪力能力：板厚 0.2 m、16 mm 筋@150 mm（A_vf ≈ 1,340 mm²/m、f_y = 420 MPa）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Estimate interface shear capacity per metre of joint with shear friction V = c·A_cv + μ·A_vf·f_y: deck 0.2 m thick with 16 mm bars at 150 mm (A_vf ≈ 1,340 mm²/m, f_y = 420 MPa). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b053-v13-19","title":"預鑄面處理與介面剪力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Precast surface preparation and interface shear: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「介面粗糙化與 SSD」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Interface roughening and SSD” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"預鑄廠以量規或砂填法量測介面粗糙幅度，拍照記錄每塊板的介面；吊裝後、澆置前清除灰塵油污，以噴水預濕並在澆置前確認達到 SSD 且無積水，由監造簽認後才可澆置。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"At the plant measure interface roughness amplitude by gauge or sand-patch method and photograph every panel's interface; after erection and before casting remove dust and oil, prewet by spraying and confirm SSD with no standing water just before placement, with the inspector signing off before casting. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把介面處理寫進預鑄板製造規範並列為出廠檢查項目，現場再設「介面清潔與 SSD 確認」停留點；不合格的介面以噴砂或水刀補做粗糙化後重新檢查。","observationEn":"Site practice: Write interface treatment into the precast fabrication specification as a factory inspection item, and add a site hold point for interface cleaning and SSD confirmation; nonconforming interfaces are roughened by abrasive blasting or water jetting and reinspected.","failure":"注意干擾：預鑄廠漏做緩凝劑處理，介面只是光滑的模板面，或澆置前介面乾燥吸水，UHPC 與舊混凝土之間黏結薄弱；通車後介面在收縮與車輛荷重下脫開，形成沿接縫兩側的兩條滲水裂縫。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If the plant skips the retarder treatment, leaving a smooth form face, or the interface is dry and absorbent at casting, bond between UHPC and old concrete is weak; after opening the interface separates under shrinkage and traffic, forming two leakage cracks along both sides of the joint. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"預鑄廠以量規或砂填法量測介面粗糙幅度，拍照記錄每塊板的介面；吊裝後、澆置前清除灰塵油污，以噴水預濕並在澆置前確認達到 SSD 且無積水，由監造簽認後才可澆置。","textEn":"At the plant measure interface roughness amplitude by gauge or sand-patch method and photograph every panel's interface; after erection and before casting remove dust and oil, prewet by spraying and confirm SSD with no standing water just before placement, with the inspector signing off before casting.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把介面處理寫進預鑄板製造規範並列為出廠檢查項目，現場再設「介面清潔與 SSD 確認」停留點；不合格的介面以噴砂或水刀補做粗糙化後重新檢查。","textEn":"Write interface treatment into the precast fabrication specification as a factory inspection item, and add a site hold point for interface cleaning and SSD confirmation; nonconforming interfaces are roughened by abrasive blasting or water jetting and reinspected.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「預鑄面處理與介面剪力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Precast surface preparation and interface shear\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","預鑄廠以量規或砂填法量測介面粗糙幅度，拍照記錄每塊板的介面；吊裝後、澆置前清除灰塵油污，以噴水預濕並在澆置前確認達到 SSD 且無積水，由監造簽認後才可澆置。","UHPC 是無收縮材料，不需要考慮收縮與溫差。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","At the plant measure interface roughness amplitude by gauge or sand-patch method and photograph every panel's interface.","UHPC is a non-shrink material, so shrinkage and temperature need not be considered."],"answer":1,"explanation":"預鑄廠以量規或砂填法量測介面粗糙幅度，拍照記錄每塊板的介面；吊裝後、澆置前清除灰塵油污，以噴水預濕並在澆置前確認達到 SSD 且無積水，由監造簽認後才可澆置。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"At the plant measure interface roughness amplitude by gauge or sand-patch method and photograph every panel's interface; after erection and before casting remove dust and oil, prewet by spraying and confirm SSD with no standing water just before placement, with the inspector signing off before casting. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b053-v13-20","title":"預鑄面處理與介面剪力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Precast surface preparation and interface shear: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「介面粗糙化與 SSD」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Interface roughening and SSD” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"預鑄廠漏做緩凝劑處理，介面只是光滑的模板面，或澆置前介面乾燥吸水，UHPC 與舊混凝土之間黏結薄弱；通車後介面在收縮與車輛荷重下脫開，形成沿接縫兩側的兩條滲水裂縫。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If the plant skips the retarder treatment, leaving a smooth form face, or the interface is dry and absorbent at casting, bond between UHPC and old concrete is weak; after opening the interface separates under shrinkage and traffic, forming two leakage cracks along both sides of the joint. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：澆置前預鑄面要預濕到飽和面乾（SSD），避免乾燥的舊混凝土吸走 UHPC 介面的水分，但表面不得有積水。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Before placement the precast face is prewetted to saturated surface-dry (SSD) so dry old concrete does not draw water from the UHPC at the interface, but no standing water may remain.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「UHPC 黏結力很強，預鑄介面平滑也沒關係。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"UHPC bonds so strongly that a smooth precast interface does not matter.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"預鑄廠漏做緩凝劑處理，介面只是光滑的模板面，或澆置前介面乾燥吸水，UHPC 與舊混凝土之間黏結薄弱；通車後介面在收縮與車輛荷重下脫開，形成沿接縫兩側的兩條滲水裂縫。","textEn":"If the plant skips the retarder treatment, leaving a smooth form face, or the interface is dry and absorbent at casting, bond between UHPC and old concrete is weak; after opening the interface separates under shrinkage and traffic, forming two leakage cracks along both sides of the joint.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「預鑄面處理與介面剪力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Precast surface preparation and interface shear\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","UHPC 可以像一般混凝土一樣用普通模板，漏一點漿不影響品質。","預鑄廠漏做緩凝劑處理，介面只是光滑的模板面，或澆置前介面乾燥吸水，UHPC 與舊混凝土之間黏結薄弱。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","UHPC can use ordinary formwork, and a little paste leakage does not matter.","If the plant skips the retarder treatment, leaving a smooth form face, or the interface is dry and absorbent at casting, bond between UHPC and old concrete is weak."],"answer":2,"explanation":"預鑄廠漏做緩凝劑處理，介面只是光滑的模板面，或澆置前介面乾燥吸水，UHPC 與舊混凝土之間黏結薄弱；通車後介面在收縮與車輛荷重下脫開，形成沿接縫兩側的兩條滲水裂縫。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the plant skips the retarder treatment, leaving a smooth form face, or the interface is dry and absorbent at casting, bond between UHPC and old concrete is weak; after opening the interface separates under shrinkage and traffic, forming two leakage cracks along both sides of the joint. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b053-v13-21","title":"模板、澆置、溢流與養護：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Formwork, placement, overfill and curing: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-20"],"objective":"說明「模板密封與溢流頭」如何影響橋面超高性能混凝土接縫的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Form sealing and overfill head” governs force, deformation or durability in “UHPC bridge-deck closure joints”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"UHPC 流動性極高、顆粒極細，任何一般混凝土可接受的模板縫隙都可能漏漿，造成接縫內部空洞與表面下陷；它也會在模板上產生接近液體的側壓。FHWA 建議模板要比一般混凝土更密實、讓空氣有排出路徑，並在高處設置「煙囪」提供額外液壓頭，補償澆置後的沉降；有些承包商以注水測試模板是否漏水。可見的水平表面常刻意溢流，硬化後研磨到與兩側齊平，但研磨太早會撕裂 UHPC、太晚則磨耗設備。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「模板密封與溢流頭」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"UHPC is highly fluid with very fine particles, so form gaps acceptable for ordinary concrete can leak paste, leaving voids inside the joint and a sunken surface; it also exerts near-hydrostatic pressure on the forms. FHWA advises forms tighter than for ordinary concrete, an exit path for air and a raised chimney that provides extra head to offset subsidence after placement; some contractors water-test the forms for leaks. Visible horizontal surfaces are often overfilled and ground flush with the adjacent deck after hardening, but grinding too early tears the UHPC and too late wears out the equipment. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Form sealing and overfill head” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：液態側壓 p = ρ·g·h。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Fluid form pressure p = ρ·g·h.","failure":"常見誤解：「UHPC 可以像一般混凝土一樣用普通模板，漏一點漿不影響品質。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"UHPC can use ordinary formwork, and a little paste leakage does not matter.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「模板密封與溢流頭」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Form sealing and overfill head”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-21-k1","title":"模板、澆置、溢流與養護","titleEn":"Formwork, placement, overfill and curing","text":"UHPC 流動性極高、顆粒極細，任何一般混凝土可接受的模板縫隙都可能漏漿，造成接縫內部空洞與表面下陷；它也會在模板上產生接近液體的側壓。FHWA 建議模板要比一般混凝土更密實、讓空氣有排出路徑，並在高處設置「煙囪」提供額外液壓頭，補償澆置後的沉降；有些承包商以注水測試模板是否漏水。","textEn":"UHPC is highly fluid with very fine particles, so form gaps acceptable for ordinary concrete can leak paste, leaving voids inside the joint and a sunken surface; it also exerts near-hydrostatic pressure on the forms. FHWA advises forms tighter than for ordinary concrete, an exit path for air and a raised chimney that provides extra head to offset subsidence after placement; some contractors water-test the forms for leaks.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：UHPC 可以像一般混凝土一樣用普通模板，漏一點漿不影響品質。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: UHPC can use ordinary formwork, and a little paste leakage does not matter. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「模板、澆置、溢流與養護」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Formwork, placement, overfill and curing\" is correct?","options":["UHPC 流動性極高、顆粒極細，任何一般混凝土可接受的模板縫隙都可能漏漿，造成接縫內部空洞與表面下陷；它也會在模板上產生接近液體的側壓。","UHPC 可以像一般混凝土一樣用普通模板，漏一點漿不影響品質。","UHPC 一定很強，只要按配比拌合就不必做驗收試驗。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC is highly fluid with very fine particles, so form gaps acceptable for ordinary concrete can leak paste, leaving voids inside the joint and a sunken surface.","UHPC can use ordinary formwork, and a little paste leakage does not matter.","UHPC is always strong, so batching by the recipe makes acceptance testing unnecessary."],"answer":0,"explanation":"UHPC 流動性極高、顆粒極細，任何一般混凝土可接受的模板縫隙都可能漏漿，造成接縫內部空洞與表面下陷；它也會在模板上產生接近液體的側壓。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"UHPC is highly fluid with very fine particles, so form gaps acceptable for ordinary concrete can leak paste, leaving voids inside the joint and a sunken surface; it also exerts near-hydrostatic pressure on the forms. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b053-v13-22","title":"模板、澆置、溢流與養護：定量估算","titleEn":"Formwork, placement, overfill and curing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「模板密封與溢流頭」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Form sealing and overfill head” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：液態側壓 p = ρ·g·h。UHPC 密度取 2,550 kg/m³，板厚 0.2 m 加溢流頭 0.15 m，h = 0.35 m，p = 2,550×9.81×0.35 ≈ 8.8 kPa。一道 12 m 長、152 mm 寬的接縫體積 0.152×0.2×12 ≈ 0.365 m³，含 10% 損耗約 0.40 m³。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Fluid form pressure p = ρ·g·h. With UHPC density 2,550 kg/m³ and a 0.2 m deck plus 0.15 m overfill head, h = 0.35 m and p = 2,550×9.81×0.35 ≈ 8.8 kPa. A 12 m long, 152 mm wide joint holds 0.152×0.2×12 ≈ 0.365 m³, about 0.40 m³ with 10% waste. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：澆置前檢查模板密封與注水試驗結果、排氣路徑與溢流頭高度；澆置時由一端連續推進，觀察另一端與排氣孔出漿；初凝前保持封閉保濕，記錄養護溫度，並依 FHWA 建議在強度達約 70 MPa 前防止受凍、達 97 MPa（14 ksi）後才拆模與承受施工荷重。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before casting check form sealing and any water-test result, air vents and overfill head height; place continuously from one end, watching for paste at the far end and vents; keep sealed and moist until initial set, log curing temperatures, and per FHWA guidance protect from freezing until about 70 MPa and strip forms or apply construction load only after 97 MPa (14 ksi).","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"液態側壓 p = ρ·g·h。UHPC 密度取 2,550 kg/m³，板厚 0.2 m 加溢流頭 0.15 m，h = 0.35 m，p = 2,550×9.81×0.35 ≈ 8.8 kPa。一道 12 m 長、152 mm 寬的接縫體積 0.152×0.2×12 ≈ 0.365 m³，含 10% 損耗約 0.40 m³。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Fluid form pressure p = ρ·g·h. With UHPC density 2,550 kg/m³ and a 0.2 m deck plus 0.15 m overfill head, h = 0.35 m and p = 2,550×9.81×0.35 ≈ 8.8 kPa. A 12 m long, 152 mm wide joint holds 0.152×0.2×12 ≈ 0.365 m³, about 0.40 m³ with 10% waste. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「模板、澆置、溢流與養護」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Formwork, placement, overfill and curing\", which statement holds?","options":["UHPC 不透水，所以整條接縫及其周邊都不會發生腐蝕。","液態側壓 p = ρ·g·h。","UHPC 強度極高，所以接縫處絕對不會開裂。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC is impermeable, so neither the joint nor its surroundings can corrode.","Fluid form pressure p = ρ·g·h.","UHPC is so strong that the joint can never crack."],"answer":1,"explanation":"液態側壓 p = ρ·g·h。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Fluid form pressure p = ρ·g·h. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b053-v13-23","title":"模板、澆置、溢流與養護：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Formwork, placement, overfill and curing: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「模板密封與溢流頭」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Form sealing and overfill head” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"澆置前檢查模板密封與注水試驗結果、排氣路徑與溢流頭高度；澆置時由一端連續推進，觀察另一端與排氣孔出漿；初凝前保持封閉保濕，記錄養護溫度，並依 FHWA 建議在強度達約 70 MPa 前防止受凍、達 97 MPa（14 ksi）後才拆模與承受施工荷重。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before casting check form sealing and any water-test result, air vents and overfill head height; place continuously from one end, watching for paste at the far end and vents; keep sealed and moist until initial set, log curing temperatures, and per FHWA guidance protect from freezing until about 70 MPa and strip forms or apply construction load only after 97 MPa (14 ksi). Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：首道接縫前做一次實尺寸試澆（mock-up），驗證模板密封、拌合、澆置順序、溢流與研磨時機；拆模與開放施工荷重以試體強度為停留點，而非以天數判斷。","observationEn":"Site practice: Before the first joint, cast a full-size mock-up to prove form sealing, mixing, placement sequence, overfill and grinding timing; stripping and construction loading are hold points based on specimen strength, not on elapsed days.","failure":"注意干擾：模板底部縫隙漏漿，接縫底部形成蜂窩與空洞，頂面下陷後只能以一般砂漿補平；或在強度不足時就研磨與開放施工車輛，表面被撕裂、纖維外露，接縫頂面成為日後滲水與剝落的起點。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Paste leaking from gaps at the bottom of the forms leaves honeycombing and voids at the joint base, and the sunken top is patched with ordinary mortar; grinding or allowing site traffic before adequate strength tears the surface and exposes fibres, starting future leakage and spalling at the joint top. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"澆置前檢查模板密封與注水試驗結果、排氣路徑與溢流頭高度；澆置時由一端連續推進，觀察另一端與排氣孔出漿；初凝前保持封閉保濕，記錄養護溫度，並依 FHWA 建議在強度達約 70 MPa 前防止受凍、達 97 MPa（14 ksi）後才拆模與承受施工荷重。","textEn":"Before casting check form sealing and any water-test result, air vents and overfill head height; place continuously from one end, watching for paste at the far end and vents; keep sealed and moist until initial set, log curing temperatures, and per FHWA guidance protect from freezing until about 70 MPa and strip forms or apply construction load only after 97 MPa (14 ksi).","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"首道接縫前做一次實尺寸試澆（mock-up），驗證模板密封、拌合、澆置順序、溢流與研磨時機；拆模與開放施工荷重以試體強度為停留點，而非以天數判斷。","textEn":"Before the first joint, cast a full-size mock-up to prove form sealing, mixing, placement sequence, overfill and grinding timing; stripping and construction loading are hold points based on specimen strength, not on elapsed days.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「模板、澆置、溢流與養護」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Formwork, placement, overfill and curing\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","UHPC 握裹力很強，鋼筋搭接長度可以隨意縮短。","澆置前檢查模板密封與注水試驗結果、排氣路徑與溢流頭高度。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","UHPC bonds so well that lap length can be shortened at will.","Before casting check form sealing and any water-test result, air vents and overfill head height."],"answer":2,"explanation":"澆置前檢查模板密封與注水試驗結果、排氣路徑與溢流頭高度；澆置時由一端連續推進，觀察另一端與排氣孔出漿；初凝前保持封閉保濕，記錄養護溫度，並依 FHWA 建議在強度達約 70 MPa 前防止受凍、達 97 MPa（14 ksi）後才拆模與承受施工荷重。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before casting check form sealing and any water-test result, air vents and overfill head height; place continuously from one end, watching for paste at the far end and vents; keep sealed and moist until initial set, log curing temperatures, and per FHWA guidance protect from freezing until about 70 MPa and strip forms or apply construction load only after 97 MPa (14 ksi). Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b053-v13-24","title":"模板、澆置、溢流與養護：失效診斷","titleEn":"Formwork, placement, overfill and curing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「模板密封與溢流頭」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Form sealing and overfill head” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"模板底部縫隙漏漿，接縫底部形成蜂窩與空洞，頂面下陷後只能以一般砂漿補平；或在強度不足時就研磨與開放施工車輛，表面被撕裂、纖維外露，接縫頂面成為日後滲水與剝落的起點。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Paste leaking from gaps at the bottom of the forms leaves honeycombing and voids at the joint base, and the sunken top is patched with ordinary mortar; grinding or allowing site traffic before adequate strength tears the surface and exposes fibres, starting future leakage and spalling at the joint top. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：可見的水平表面常刻意溢流，硬化後研磨到與兩側齊平，但研磨太早會撕裂 UHPC、太晚則磨耗設備。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Visible horizontal surfaces are often overfilled and ground flush with the adjacent deck after hardening, but grinding too early tears the UHPC and too late wears out the equipment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「UHPC 可以像一般混凝土一樣用普通模板，漏一點漿不影響品質。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"UHPC can use ordinary formwork, and a little paste leakage does not matter.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"模板底部縫隙漏漿，接縫底部形成蜂窩與空洞，頂面下陷後只能以一般砂漿補平；或在強度不足時就研磨與開放施工車輛，表面被撕裂、纖維外露，接縫頂面成為日後滲水與剝落的起點。","textEn":"Paste leaking from gaps at the bottom of the forms leaves honeycombing and voids at the joint base, and the sunken top is patched with ordinary mortar; grinding or allowing site traffic before adequate strength tears the surface and exposes fibres, starting future leakage and spalling at the joint top.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「模板、澆置、溢流與養護」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Formwork, placement, overfill and curing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["模板底部縫隙漏漿，接縫底部形成蜂窩與空洞，頂面下陷後只能以一般砂漿補平。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","UHPC 一定很強，只要按配比拌合就不必做驗收試驗。"],"optionsEn":["Paste leaking from gaps at the bottom of the forms leaves honeycombing and voids at the joint base, and the sunken top is patched with ordinary mortar.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","UHPC is always strong, so batching by the recipe makes acceptance testing unnecessary."],"answer":0,"explanation":"模板底部縫隙漏漿，接縫底部形成蜂窩與空洞，頂面下陷後只能以一般砂漿補平；或在強度不足時就研磨與開放施工車輛，表面被撕裂、纖維外露，接縫頂面成為日後滲水與剝落的起點。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Paste leaking from gaps at the bottom of the forms leaves honeycombing and voids at the joint base, and the sunken top is patched with ordinary mortar; grinding or allowing site traffic before adequate strength tears the surface and exposes fibres, starting future leakage and spalling at the joint top. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b053-v13-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「材料驗收試驗」與「接縫性能驗證與監測」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Material acceptance testing\" and \"Joint performance verification and monitoring\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b053-v13-25","title":"材料驗收試驗：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Material acceptance testing: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-24"],"objective":"說明「流度與抗壓試體」如何影響橋面超高性能混凝土接縫的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Flow and compression specimens” governs force, deformation or durability in “UHPC bridge-deck closure joints”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"UHPC 的現場驗收比一般混凝土更依賴試驗：每一盤都要以流度試驗確認工作性，因為流度太低會包住空氣、太高可能代表加水或纖維沉降；抗壓試體則決定何時可拆模、何時可承載。FHWA 建議的驗收項目包括流度約 178 至 254 mm、4 天抗壓大於 14 ksi、28 天大於 21 ksi、氯離子滲透 28 天不超過 250 庫侖、凍融 300 次後相對動彈性模數至少 95%、28 天收縮不超過 800 微應變，抗壓試體至少每 19 m³ 或每 12 小時班次取一次。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「流度與抗壓試體」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Site acceptance of UHPC relies on testing even more than for ordinary concrete: every batch is flow-tested for workability, because low flow traps air and high flow may mean added water or fibre settlement, while compressive specimens decide when forms come off and when load may be applied. FHWA-recommended acceptance covers flow of about 178 to 254 mm, compressive strength above 14 ksi at 4 days and above 21 ksi at 28 days, chloride penetrability of at most 250 coulombs at 28 days, relative dynamic modulus of at least 95% after 300 freeze–thaw cycles and 28-day shrinkage of at most 800 microstrain, with compressive specimens taken at least once per 19 m³ or per 12-hour shift. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Flow and compression specimens” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：直徑 76.2 mm 圓柱試體面積 A = π/4×76.2² ≈ 4,560 mm²，破壞荷重 680 kN，f = 680,000/4,560 ≈ 149 MPa，高於 21 ksi（約 145 MPa）；試驗機容量需大於 680 kN 並預留餘裕，試體端面需研磨平整。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A 76.2 mm diameter cylinder has A = π/4×76.2² ≈ 4,560 mm²; a failure load of 680 kN gives f = 680,000/4,560 ≈ 149 MPa, above 21 ksi (about 145 MPa); the testing machine must exceed 680 kN with margin and specimen ends must be ground flat.","failure":"常見誤解：「UHPC 一定很強，只要按配比拌合就不必做驗收試驗。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"UHPC is always strong, so batching by the recipe makes acceptance testing unnecessary.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「流度與抗壓試體」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Flow and compression specimens”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-25-k1","title":"材料驗收試驗","titleEn":"Material acceptance testing","text":"UHPC 的現場驗收比一般混凝土更依賴試驗：每一盤都要以流度試驗確認工作性，因為流度太低會包住空氣、太高可能代表加水或纖維沉降；抗壓試體則決定何時可拆模、何時可承載。FHWA 建議的驗收項目包括流度約 178 至 254 mm、4 天抗壓大於 14 ksi、28 天大於 21 ksi、氯離子滲透 28 天不超過 250 庫侖、凍融 300 次後相對動彈性模數至少 95%、28 天收縮不超過 800 微應變，抗壓試體至少每 19 m³ 或每 12 小時班次取一次。","textEn":"Site acceptance of UHPC relies on testing even more than for ordinary concrete: every batch is flow-tested for workability, because low flow traps air and high flow may mean added water or fibre settlement, while compressive specimens decide when forms come off and when load may be applied. FHWA-recommended acceptance covers flow of about 178 to 254 mm, compressive strength above 14 ksi at 4 days and above 21 ksi at 28 days, chloride penetrability of at most 250 coulombs at 28 days, relative dynamic modulus of at least 95% after 300 freeze–thaw cycles and 28-day shrinkage of at most 800 microstrain, with compressive specimens taken at least once per 19 m³ or per 12-hour shift.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：UHPC 一定很強，只要按配比拌合就不必做驗收試驗。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: UHPC is always strong, so batching by the recipe makes acceptance testing unnecessary. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「材料驗收試驗」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Material acceptance testing\" is correct?","options":["UHPC 一定很強，只要按配比拌合就不必做驗收試驗。","UHPC 的現場驗收比一般混凝土更依賴試驗：每一盤都要以流度試驗確認工作性，因為流度太低會包住空氣、太高可能代表加水或纖維沉降。","接縫只要表面看不到裂縫，就代表不會滲水。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC is always strong, so batching by the recipe makes acceptance testing unnecessary.","Site acceptance of UHPC relies on testing even more than for ordinary concrete: every batch is flow-tested for workability, because low flow traps air and high flow may mean added water or fibre settlement, while compressive specimens decide when forms come off and when load may be applied.","If no crack is visible on the joint surface, it cannot leak."],"answer":1,"explanation":"UHPC 的現場驗收比一般混凝土更依賴試驗：每一盤都要以流度試驗確認工作性，因為流度太低會包住空氣、太高可能代表加水或纖維沉降；抗壓試體則決定何時可拆模、何時可承載。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Site acceptance of UHPC relies on testing even more than for ordinary concrete: every batch is flow-tested for workability, because low flow traps air and high flow may mean added water or fibre settlement, while compressive specimens decide when forms come off and when load may be applied. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b053-v13-26","title":"材料驗收試驗：定量估算","titleEn":"Material acceptance testing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「流度與抗壓試體」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Flow and compression specimens” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：直徑 76.2 mm 圓柱試體面積 A = π/4×76.2² ≈ 4,560 mm²，破壞荷重 680 kN，f = 680,000/4,560 ≈ 149 MPa，高於 21 ksi（約 145 MPa）；試驗機容量需大於 680 kN 並預留餘裕，試體端面需研磨平整。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A 76.2 mm diameter cylinder has A = π/4×76.2² ≈ 4,560 mm²; a failure load of 680 kN gives f = 680,000/4,560 ≈ 149 MPa, above 21 ksi (about 145 MPa); the testing machine must exceed 680 kN with margin and specimen ends must be ground flat. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：每盤記錄拌合時間、溫度與流度，流度超出範圍即退料；抗壓試體依規定頻率取樣並與接縫同條件養護，另取一組標準養護；試驗報告須標明試體尺寸、端面處理與試驗機容量，結果與允收值比較後決定拆模與開放。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record mixing time, temperature and flow for every batch, rejecting any outside the range; take compression specimens at the required frequency, cured alongside the joint, plus a standard-cured set; reports state specimen size, end preparation and machine capacity, and results are compared with acceptance values to decide stripping and opening.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"直徑 76.2 mm 圓柱試體面積 A = π/4×76.2² ≈ 4,560 mm²，破壞荷重 680 kN，f = 680,000/4,560 ≈ 149 MPa，高於 21 ksi（約 145 MPa）；試驗機容量需大於 680 kN 並預留餘裕，試體端面需研磨平整。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"A 76.2 mm diameter cylinder has A = π/4×76.2² ≈ 4,560 mm²; a failure load of 680 kN gives f = 680,000/4,560 ≈ 149 MPa, above 21 ksi (about 145 MPa); the testing machine must exceed 680 kN with margin and specimen ends must be ground flat. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「材料驗收試驗」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Material acceptance testing\", which statement holds?","options":["UHPC 接縫耐久性極高，交接後就不需要任何紀錄或維修規劃。","UHPC 是無收縮材料，不需要考慮收縮與溫差。","直徑 76.2 mm 圓柱試體面積 A = π/4×76.2² ≈ 4,560 mm²，破壞荷重 680 kN，f = 680,000/4,560 ≈ 149 MPa，高於 21 ksi（約 145 MPa）。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC joints are so durable that no records or repair planning are needed after handover.","UHPC is a non-shrink material, so shrinkage and temperature need not be considered.","A 76.2 mm diameter cylinder has A = π/4×76.2² ≈ 4,560 mm²."],"answer":2,"explanation":"直徑 76.2 mm 圓柱試體面積 A = π/4×76.2² ≈ 4,560 mm²，破壞荷重 680 kN，f = 680,000/4,560 ≈ 149 MPa，高於 21 ksi（約 145 MPa）；試驗機容量需大於 680 kN 並預留餘裕，試體端面需研磨平整。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A 76.2 mm diameter cylinder has A = π/4×76.2² ≈ 4,560 mm²; a failure load of 680 kN gives f = 680,000/4,560 ≈ 149 MPa, above 21 ksi (about 145 MPa); the testing machine must exceed 680 kN with margin and specimen ends must be ground flat. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b053-v13-27","title":"材料驗收試驗：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Material acceptance testing: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「流度與抗壓試體」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Flow and compression specimens” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"每盤記錄拌合時間、溫度與流度，流度超出範圍即退料；抗壓試體依規定頻率取樣並與接縫同條件養護，另取一組標準養護；試驗報告須標明試體尺寸、端面處理與試驗機容量，結果與允收值比較後決定拆模與開放。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record mixing time, temperature and flow for every batch, rejecting any outside the range; take compression specimens at the required frequency, cured alongside the joint, plus a standard-cured set; reports state specimen size, end preparation and machine capacity, and results are compared with acceptance values to decide stripping and opening. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：品質計畫列出每項試驗的標準、頻率與允收值，指定具 UHPC 試驗能力的實驗室；流度不合格的批次一律不得澆入接縫，且由監造見證取樣。","observationEn":"Site practice: The quality plan lists standard, frequency and acceptance value for each test and names a laboratory capable of UHPC testing; batches failing flow may not be placed in the joint, and sampling is witnessed by the inspector.","failure":"注意干擾：以一般混凝土實驗室的試驗機與未研磨端面測試 UHPC，量到的強度偏低或試驗機容量不足；或只取 28 天試體，沒有早期強度資料，結果為趕工在未達要求強度時就拆模開放，接縫在早期就受損。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Testing UHPC on an ordinary concrete lab machine with unground ends gives low strengths or exceeds machine capacity; taking only 28-day specimens leaves no early-strength data, so forms are stripped and traffic admitted to meet the schedule before the required strength, damaging the joint early. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每盤記錄拌合時間、溫度與流度，流度超出範圍即退料；抗壓試體依規定頻率取樣並與接縫同條件養護，另取一組標準養護；試驗報告須標明試體尺寸、端面處理與試驗機容量，結果與允收值比較後決定拆模與開放。","textEn":"Record mixing time, temperature and flow for every batch, rejecting any outside the range; take compression specimens at the required frequency, cured alongside the joint, plus a standard-cured set; reports state specimen size, end preparation and machine capacity, and results are compared with acceptance values to decide stripping and opening.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"品質計畫列出每項試驗的標準、頻率與允收值，指定具 UHPC 試驗能力的實驗室；流度不合格的批次一律不得澆入接縫，且由監造見證取樣。","textEn":"The quality plan lists standard, frequency and acceptance value for each test and names a laboratory capable of UHPC testing; batches failing flow may not be placed in the joint, and sampling is witnessed by the inspector.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「材料驗收試驗」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Material acceptance testing\"?","options":["每盤記錄拌合時間、溫度與流度，流度超出範圍即退料。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","UHPC 只是強度比較高的混凝土，配比與纖維可以由現場自行調整。"],"optionsEn":["Record mixing time, temperature and flow for every batch, rejecting any outside the range.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","UHPC is just stronger concrete, so mix and fibre content can be adjusted on site."],"answer":0,"explanation":"每盤記錄拌合時間、溫度與流度，流度超出範圍即退料；抗壓試體依規定頻率取樣並與接縫同條件養護，另取一組標準養護；試驗報告須標明試體尺寸、端面處理與試驗機容量，結果與允收值比較後決定拆模與開放。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record mixing time, temperature and flow for every batch, rejecting any outside the range; take compression specimens at the required frequency, cured alongside the joint, plus a standard-cured set; reports state specimen size, end preparation and machine capacity, and results are compared with acceptance values to decide stripping and opening. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b053-v13-28","title":"材料驗收試驗：失效診斷","titleEn":"Material acceptance testing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「流度與抗壓試體」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Flow and compression specimens” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"以一般混凝土實驗室的試驗機與未研磨端面測試 UHPC，量到的強度偏低或試驗機容量不足；或只取 28 天試體，沒有早期強度資料，結果為趕工在未達要求強度時就拆模開放，接縫在早期就受損。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Testing UHPC on an ordinary concrete lab machine with unground ends gives low strengths or exceeds machine capacity; taking only 28-day specimens leaves no early-strength data, so forms are stripped and traffic admitted to meet the schedule before the required strength, damaging the joint early. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：FHWA 建議的驗收項目包括流度約 178 至 254 mm、4 天抗壓大於 14 ksi、28 天大於 21 ksi、氯離子滲透 28 天不超過 250 庫侖、凍融 300 次後相對動彈性模數至少 95%、28 天收縮不超過 800 微應變，抗壓試體至少每 19 m³ 或每 12 小時班次取一次。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: FHWA-recommended acceptance covers flow of about 178 to 254 mm, compressive strength above 14 ksi at 4 days and above 21 ksi at 28 days, chloride penetrability of at most 250 coulombs at 28 days, relative dynamic modulus of at least 95% after 300 freeze–thaw cycles and 28-day shrinkage of at most 800 microstrain, with compressive specimens taken at least once per 19 m³ or per 12-hour shift.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「UHPC 一定很強，只要按配比拌合就不必做驗收試驗。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"UHPC is always strong, so batching by the recipe makes acceptance testing unnecessary.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"以一般混凝土實驗室的試驗機與未研磨端面測試 UHPC，量到的強度偏低或試驗機容量不足；或只取 28 天試體，沒有早期強度資料，結果為趕工在未達要求強度時就拆模開放，接縫在早期就受損。","textEn":"Testing UHPC on an ordinary concrete lab machine with unground ends gives low strengths or exceeds machine capacity; taking only 28-day specimens leaves no early-strength data, so forms are stripped and traffic admitted to meet the schedule before the required strength, damaging the joint early.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「材料驗收試驗」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Material acceptance testing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","以一般混凝土實驗室的試驗機與未研磨端面測試 UHPC，量到的強度偏低或試驗機容量不足。","接縫只要表面看不到裂縫，就代表不會滲水。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Testing UHPC on an ordinary concrete lab machine with unground ends gives low strengths or exceeds machine capacity.","If no crack is visible on the joint surface, it cannot leak."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以一般混凝土實驗室的試驗機與未研磨端面測試 UHPC，量到的強度偏低或試驗機容量不足；或只取 28 天試體，沒有早期強度資料，結果為趕工在未達要求強度時就拆模開放，接縫在早期就受損。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Testing UHPC on an ordinary concrete lab machine with unground ends gives low strengths or exceeds machine capacity; taking only 28-day specimens leaves no early-strength data, so forms are stripped and traffic admitted to meet the schedule before the required strength, damaging the joint early. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b053-v13-29","title":"接縫性能驗證與監測：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Joint performance verification and monitoring: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-28"],"objective":"說明「跨縫應變與噴水試驗」如何影響橋面超高性能混凝土接縫的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Cross-joint strain and spray test” governs force, deformation or durability in “UHPC bridge-deck closure joints”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"UHPC 接縫的設計規則來自實驗室中對接縫試體的靜載與反覆載重試驗，但每座橋仍需在現場確認接縫的實際表現：通車前做噴水或灑水檢查介面是否滲漏；通車後以跨縫應變計、裂縫寬度量測與定期目視比較接縫與兩側板的行為。紐約州 2013 年在雪城 I-81 以全深度預鑄橋面板加 6 吋 UHPC 接縫更換四座州際公路橋，不使用後拉預力，南北向各以 10 天封路完成，為此類監測提供了典型對象。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「跨縫應變與噴水試驗」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Design rules for UHPC joints come from static and cyclic laboratory tests on joint specimens, yet each bridge still needs field confirmation of joint behaviour: before opening, spray or flood the joints to check for interface leaks; after opening, compare joint and panel behaviour with cross-joint strain gauges, crack-width measurements and periodic visual inspection. In 2013 New York replaced four interstate bridges on I-81 in Syracuse with full-depth precast panels and 6 inch UHPC joints, without post-tensioning, completing each direction under a 10-day closure, a typical subject for such monitoring. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Cross-joint strain and spray test” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：介面附近預鑄板側應變計在設計車輛下讀得 100 με，E_c = 30 GPa，σ = 30,000×100×10⁻⁶ = 3.0 MPa，接近一般混凝土開裂應力；UHPC 側同一荷重讀 120 με、E = 48 GPa，σ ≈ 5.8 MPa，仍低於 8.5 MPa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A gauge on the precast side near the interface reads 100 με under the design vehicle; with E_c = 30 GPa, σ = 30,000×100×10⁻⁶ = 3.0 MPa, near ordinary concrete's cracking stress; on the UHPC side the same load reads 120 με with E = 48 GPa, σ ≈ 5.8 MPa, still below 8.5 MPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「接縫只要表面看不到裂縫，就代表不會滲水。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If no crack is visible on the joint surface, it cannot leak.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「跨縫應變與噴水試驗」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Cross-joint strain and spray test”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-29-k1","title":"接縫性能驗證與監測","titleEn":"Joint performance verification and monitoring","text":"UHPC 接縫的設計規則來自實驗室中對接縫試體的靜載與反覆載重試驗，但每座橋仍需在現場確認接縫的實際表現：通車前做噴水或灑水檢查介面是否滲漏；通車後以跨縫應變計、裂縫寬度量測與定期目視比較接縫與兩側板的行為。紐約州 2013 年在雪城 I-81 以全深度預鑄橋面板加 6 吋 UHPC 接縫更換四座州際公路橋，不使用後拉預力，南北向各以 10 天封路完成，為此類監測提供了典型對象。","textEn":"Design rules for UHPC joints come from static and cyclic laboratory tests on joint specimens, yet each bridge still needs field confirmation of joint behaviour: before opening, spray or flood the joints to check for interface leaks; after opening, compare joint and panel behaviour with cross-joint strain gauges, crack-width measurements and periodic visual inspection. In 2013 New York replaced four interstate bridges on I-81 in Syracuse with full-depth precast panels and 6 inch UHPC joints, without post-tensioning, completing each direction under a 10-day closure, a typical subject for such monitoring.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：接縫只要表面看不到裂縫，就代表不會滲水。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If no crack is visible on the joint surface, it cannot leak. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「接縫性能驗證與監測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Joint performance verification and monitoring\" is correct?","options":["接縫只要表面看不到裂縫，就代表不會滲水。","UHPC 不透水，所以整條接縫及其周邊都不會發生腐蝕。","UHPC 接縫的設計規則來自實驗室中對接縫試體的靜載與反覆載重試驗，但每座橋仍需在現場確認接縫的實際表現：通車前做噴水或灑水檢查介面是否滲漏。"],"optionsEn":["If no crack is visible on the joint surface, it cannot leak.","UHPC is impermeable, so neither the joint nor its surroundings can corrode.","Design rules for UHPC joints come from static and cyclic laboratory tests on joint specimens, yet each bridge still needs field confirmation of joint behaviour: before opening, spray or flood the joints to check for interface leaks."],"answer":2,"explanation":"UHPC 接縫的設計規則來自實驗室中對接縫試體的靜載與反覆載重試驗，但每座橋仍需在現場確認接縫的實際表現：通車前做噴水或灑水檢查介面是否滲漏；通車後以跨縫應變計、裂縫寬度量測與定期目視比較接縫與兩側板的行為。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Design rules for UHPC joints come from static and cyclic laboratory tests on joint specimens, yet each bridge still needs field confirmation of joint behaviour: before opening, spray or flood the joints to check for interface leaks; after opening, compare joint and panel behaviour with cross-joint strain gauges, crack-width measurements and periodic visual inspection. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b053-v13-30","title":"接縫性能驗證與監測：定量估算","titleEn":"Joint performance verification and monitoring: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「跨縫應變與噴水試驗」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Cross-joint strain and spray test” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：介面附近預鑄板側應變計在設計車輛下讀得 100 με，E_c = 30 GPa，σ = 30,000×100×10⁻⁶ = 3.0 MPa，接近一般混凝土開裂應力；UHPC 側同一荷重讀 120 με、E = 48 GPa，σ ≈ 5.8 MPa，仍低於 8.5 MPa。數值除 UHPC 性質外為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A gauge on the precast side near the interface reads 100 με under the design vehicle; with E_c = 30 GPa, σ = 30,000×100×10⁻⁶ = 3.0 MPa, near ordinary concrete's cracking stress; on the UHPC side the same load reads 120 με with E = 48 GPa, σ ≈ 5.8 MPa, still below 8.5 MPa. Values other than UHPC properties are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：通車前以噴水或圍堰灑水檢查每道接縫底面是否有滲漏痕跡；選擇代表性接縫安裝跨縫應變計與裂縫計，以已知重量車輛做靜載與慢速通過試驗，比較跨縫與板內應變比值；之後每年目視記錄裂縫位置與寬度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before opening spray or pond each joint and check the soffit for seepage; instrument representative joints with cross-joint strain and crack gauges, run static and crawl-speed tests with known vehicles and compare strain ratios across the joint and within the panel; thereafter record crack locations and widths visually each year.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"介面附近預鑄板側應變計在設計車輛下讀得 100 με，E_c = 30 GPa，σ = 30,000×100×10⁻⁶ = 3.0 MPa，接近一般混凝土開裂應力；UHPC 側同一荷重讀 120 με、E = 48 GPa，σ ≈ 5.8 MPa，仍低於 8.5 MPa。數值除 UHPC 性質外為教學假設。","textEn":"A gauge on the precast side near the interface reads 100 με under the design vehicle; with E_c = 30 GPa, σ = 30,000×100×10⁻⁶ = 3.0 MPa, near ordinary concrete's cracking stress; on the UHPC side the same load reads 120 με with E = 48 GPa, σ ≈ 5.8 MPa, still below 8.5 MPa. Values other than UHPC properties are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「接縫性能驗證與監測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Joint performance verification and monitoring\", which statement holds?","options":["介面附近預鑄板側應變計在設計車輛下讀得 100 με，E_c = 30 GPa，σ = 30,000×100×10⁻⁶ = 3.0 MPa，接近一般混凝土開裂應力。","UHPC 強度極高，所以接縫處絕對不會開裂。","UHPC 握裹力很強，鋼筋搭接長度可以隨意縮短。"],"optionsEn":["A gauge on the precast side near the interface reads 100 με under the design vehicle.","UHPC is so strong that the joint can never crack.","UHPC bonds so well that lap length can be shortened at will."],"answer":0,"explanation":"介面附近預鑄板側應變計在設計車輛下讀得 100 με，E_c = 30 GPa，σ = 30,000×100×10⁻⁶ = 3.0 MPa，接近一般混凝土開裂應力；UHPC 側同一荷重讀 120 με、E = 48 GPa，σ ≈ 5.8 MPa，仍低於 8.5 MPa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A gauge on the precast side near the interface reads 100 με under the design vehicle; with E_c = 30 GPa, σ = 30,000×100×10⁻⁶ = 3.0 MPa, near ordinary concrete's cracking stress; on the UHPC side the same load reads 120 με with E = 48 GPa, σ ≈ 5.8 MPa, still below 8.5 MPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b053-v13-31","title":"接縫性能驗證與監測：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Joint performance verification and monitoring: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「跨縫應變與噴水試驗」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Cross-joint strain and spray test” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"通車前以噴水或圍堰灑水檢查每道接縫底面是否有滲漏痕跡；選擇代表性接縫安裝跨縫應變計與裂縫計，以已知重量車輛做靜載與慢速通過試驗，比較跨縫與板內應變比值；之後每年目視記錄裂縫位置與寬度。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before opening spray or pond each joint and check the soffit for seepage; instrument representative joints with cross-joint strain and crack gauges, run static and crawl-speed tests with known vehicles and compare strain ratios across the joint and within the panel; thereafter record crack locations and widths visually each year. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把「通車前滲水檢查」列為驗收停留點，滲漏處須在通車前以注射或表面封護處理；代表性接縫的監測資料連同試驗車重量與位置一起存檔，作為長期比較的基準。","observationEn":"Site practice: Make the pre-opening leak check an acceptance hold point and treat any leak by injection or surface sealing before opening; archive monitoring data for representative joints with test-vehicle weights and positions as the long-term baseline.","failure":"注意干擾：只檢查 UHPC 本體是否有裂縫，忽略介面細縫；介面滲漏未在通車前發現，冬季除冰鹽水沿介面滲到下方，等到梁底出現鏽水才察覺，修補時必須封路處理。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Checking only the UHPC for cracks while ignoring fine interface cracks lets interface leaks go unnoticed before opening; winter brine then seeps to the girders below and the problem is found only when rust stains appear, requiring a closure to repair. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"通車前以噴水或圍堰灑水檢查每道接縫底面是否有滲漏痕跡；選擇代表性接縫安裝跨縫應變計與裂縫計，以已知重量車輛做靜載與慢速通過試驗，比較跨縫與板內應變比值；之後每年目視記錄裂縫位置與寬度。","textEn":"Before opening spray or pond each joint and check the soffit for seepage; instrument representative joints with cross-joint strain and crack gauges, run static and crawl-speed tests with known vehicles and compare strain ratios across the joint and within the panel; thereafter record crack locations and widths visually each year.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把「通車前滲水檢查」列為驗收停留點，滲漏處須在通車前以注射或表面封護處理；代表性接縫的監測資料連同試驗車重量與位置一起存檔，作為長期比較的基準。","textEn":"Make the pre-opening leak check an acceptance hold point and treat any leak by injection or surface sealing before opening; archive monitoring data for representative joints with test-vehicle weights and positions as the long-term baseline.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「接縫性能驗證與監測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Joint performance verification and monitoring\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","通車前以噴水或圍堰灑水檢查每道接縫底面是否有滲漏痕跡。","UHPC 黏結力很強，預鑄介面平滑也沒關係。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Before opening spray or pond each joint and check the soffit for seepage.","UHPC bonds so strongly that a smooth precast interface does not matter."],"answer":1,"explanation":"通車前以噴水或圍堰灑水檢查每道接縫底面是否有滲漏痕跡；選擇代表性接縫安裝跨縫應變計與裂縫計，以已知重量車輛做靜載與慢速通過試驗，比較跨縫與板內應變比值；之後每年目視記錄裂縫位置與寬度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before opening spray or pond each joint and check the soffit for seepage; instrument representative joints with cross-joint strain and crack gauges, run static and crawl-speed tests with known vehicles and compare strain ratios across the joint and within the panel; thereafter record crack locations and widths visually each year. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b053-v13-32","title":"接縫性能驗證與監測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Joint performance verification and monitoring: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「跨縫應變與噴水試驗」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Cross-joint strain and spray test” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只檢查 UHPC 本體是否有裂縫，忽略介面細縫；介面滲漏未在通車前發現，冬季除冰鹽水沿介面滲到下方，等到梁底出現鏽水才察覺，修補時必須封路處理。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Checking only the UHPC for cracks while ignoring fine interface cracks lets interface leaks go unnoticed before opening; winter brine then seeps to the girders below and the problem is found only when rust stains appear, requiring a closure to repair. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：紐約州 2013 年在雪城 I-81 以全深度預鑄橋面板加 6 吋 UHPC 接縫更換四座州際公路橋，不使用後拉預力，南北向各以 10 天封路完成，為此類監測提供了典型對象。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: In 2013 New York replaced four interstate bridges on I-81 in Syracuse with full-depth precast panels and 6 inch UHPC joints, without post-tensioning, completing each direction under a 10-day closure, a typical subject for such monitoring.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「接縫只要表面看不到裂縫，就代表不會滲水。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If no crack is visible on the joint surface, it cannot leak.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只檢查 UHPC 本體是否有裂縫，忽略介面細縫；介面滲漏未在通車前發現，冬季除冰鹽水沿介面滲到下方，等到梁底出現鏽水才察覺，修補時必須封路處理。","textEn":"Checking only the UHPC for cracks while ignoring fine interface cracks lets interface leaks go unnoticed before opening; winter brine then seeps to the girders below and the problem is found only when rust stains appear, requiring a closure to repair.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「接縫性能驗證與監測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Joint performance verification and monitoring\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","UHPC 不透水，所以整條接縫及其周邊都不會發生腐蝕。","只檢查 UHPC 本體是否有裂縫，忽略介面細縫；介面滲漏未在通車前發現，冬季除冰鹽水沿介面滲到下方，等到梁底出現鏽水才察覺，修補時必須封路處理。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","UHPC is impermeable, so neither the joint nor its surroundings can corrode.","Checking only the UHPC for cracks while ignoring fine interface cracks lets interface leaks go unnoticed before opening."],"answer":2,"explanation":"只檢查 UHPC 本體是否有裂縫，忽略介面細縫；介面滲漏未在通車前發現，冬季除冰鹽水沿介面滲到下方，等到梁底出現鏽水才察覺，修補時必須封路處理。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Checking only the UHPC for cracks while ignoring fine interface cracks lets interface leaks go unnoticed before opening; winter brine then seeps to the girders below and the problem is found only when rust stains appear, requiring a closure to repair. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b053-v13-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「耐久性、氯離子與接縫防水」與「維修、改建與工程交接」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Durability, chloride and joint watertightness\" and \"Repair, modification and engineering handover\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b053-v13-33","title":"耐久性、氯離子與接縫防水：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Durability, chloride and joint watertightness: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-32"],"objective":"說明「氯離子擴散深度」如何影響橋面超高性能混凝土接縫的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Chloride diffusion depth” governs force, deformation or durability in “UHPC bridge-deck closure joints”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"橋面接縫是除冰鹽與雨水最容易進入結構的位置：一般現澆接縫因收縮與荷載開裂，氯離子沿裂縫與孔隙到達鋼筋，引起腐蝕與剝落。UHPC 的孔隙不連通，FHWA 數據顯示 28 天氯離子滲透僅約 360 庫侖、凍融 600 次後相對動彈性模數仍約 99%，本體幾乎不讓氯離子進入；因此長期耐久的瓶頸轉到介面與兩側預鑄板。耐久設計要同時處理介面開裂、鋪面層與防水層，以及接縫下方排水。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「氯離子擴散深度」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Deck joints are where de-icing salt and rain most easily enter a structure: ordinary field-cast joints crack from shrinkage and load, and chlorides travel through cracks and pores to the bars, causing corrosion and spalling. UHPC's pore structure is discontinuous; FHWA data show only about 360 coulombs of chloride penetrability at 28 days and a relative dynamic modulus of about 99% after 600 freeze–thaw cycles, so the material itself admits almost no chloride, and the long-term bottleneck shifts to the interface and the adjacent precast panels. Durability design must address interface cracking, the wearing surface and waterproofing, and drainage below the joint. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Chloride diffusion depth” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：擴散深度近似 x ≈ 2√(D·t)，t = 50 年 ≈ 1.58×10⁹ s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Diffusion depth x ≈ 2√(D·t) with t = 50 years ≈ 1.58×10⁹ s.","failure":"常見誤解：「UHPC 不透水，所以整條接縫及其周邊都不會發生腐蝕。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"UHPC is impermeable, so neither the joint nor its surroundings can corrode.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「氯離子擴散深度」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Chloride diffusion depth”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-33-k1","title":"耐久性、氯離子與接縫防水","titleEn":"Durability, chloride and joint watertightness","text":"橋面接縫是除冰鹽與雨水最容易進入結構的位置：一般現澆接縫因收縮與荷載開裂，氯離子沿裂縫與孔隙到達鋼筋，引起腐蝕與剝落。UHPC 的孔隙不連通，FHWA 數據顯示 28 天氯離子滲透僅約 360 庫侖、凍融 600 次後相對動彈性模數仍約 99%，本體幾乎不讓氯離子進入；因此長期耐久的瓶頸轉到介面與兩側預鑄板。","textEn":"Deck joints are where de-icing salt and rain most easily enter a structure: ordinary field-cast joints crack from shrinkage and load, and chlorides travel through cracks and pores to the bars, causing corrosion and spalling. UHPC's pore structure is discontinuous; FHWA data show only about 360 coulombs of chloride penetrability at 28 days and a relative dynamic modulus of about 99% after 600 freeze–thaw cycles, so the material itself admits almost no chloride, and the long-term bottleneck shifts to the interface and the adjacent precast panels.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：UHPC 不透水，所以整條接縫及其周邊都不會發生腐蝕。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: UHPC is impermeable, so neither the joint nor its surroundings can corrode. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「耐久性、氯離子與接縫防水」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Durability, chloride and joint watertightness\" is correct?","options":["橋面接縫是除冰鹽與雨水最容易進入結構的位置：一般現澆接縫因收縮與荷載開裂，氯離子沿裂縫與孔隙到達鋼筋，引起腐蝕與剝落。","UHPC 不透水，所以整條接縫及其周邊都不會發生腐蝕。","UHPC 接縫耐久性極高，交接後就不需要任何紀錄或維修規劃。"],"optionsEn":["Deck joints are where de-icing salt and rain most easily enter a structure: ordinary field-cast joints crack from shrinkage and load, and chlorides travel through cracks and pores to the bars, causing corrosion and spalling.","UHPC is impermeable, so neither the joint nor its surroundings can corrode.","UHPC joints are so durable that no records or repair planning are needed after handover."],"answer":0,"explanation":"橋面接縫是除冰鹽與雨水最容易進入結構的位置：一般現澆接縫因收縮與荷載開裂，氯離子沿裂縫與孔隙到達鋼筋，引起腐蝕與剝落。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Deck joints are where de-icing salt and rain most easily enter a structure: ordinary field-cast joints crack from shrinkage and load, and chlorides travel through cracks and pores to the bars, causing corrosion and spalling. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b053-v13-34","title":"耐久性、氯離子與接縫防水：定量估算","titleEn":"Durability, chloride and joint watertightness: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「氯離子擴散深度」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Chloride diffusion depth” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：擴散深度近似 x ≈ 2√(D·t)，t = 50 年 ≈ 1.58×10⁹ s。一般混凝土 D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s：x ≈ 2√(1.58×10⁻³) ≈ 0.079 m = 79 mm，超過 50 mm 保護層；UHPC 取 D = 2×10⁻¹⁴ m²/s：x ≈ 11 mm。數值為教學假設，介面裂縫不適用擴散模型。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Diffusion depth x ≈ 2√(D·t) with t = 50 years ≈ 1.58×10⁹ s. Ordinary concrete with D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s gives x ≈ 2√(1.58×10⁻³) ≈ 0.079 m = 79 mm, beyond 50 mm cover; UHPC with D = 2×10⁻¹⁴ m²/s gives x ≈ 11 mm. Values are teaching assumptions; diffusion does not apply through interface cracks. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：定期以目視、敲擊與裂縫量測檢查接縫與介面；在介面附近的預鑄板鑽取粉末測氯離子濃度剖面，與基準比較；鋪面層若覆蓋接縫，翻修時要檢查其下方介面，並確認排水坡度與排水孔暢通。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Inspect joints and interfaces periodically by eye, sounding and crack measurement; drill powder samples in the precast panel near the interface for chloride profiles compared with the baseline; where an overlay covers the joint, inspect the interface beneath it during resurfacing and confirm drainage falls and outlets are clear.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"擴散深度近似 x ≈ 2√(D·t)，t = 50 年 ≈ 1.58×10⁹ s。一般混凝土 D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s：x ≈ 2√(1.58×10⁻³) ≈ 0.079 m = 79 mm，超過 50 mm 保護層；UHPC 取 D = 2×10⁻¹⁴ m²/s：x ≈ 11 mm。數值為教學假設，介面裂縫不適用擴散模型。","textEn":"Diffusion depth x ≈ 2√(D·t) with t = 50 years ≈ 1.58×10⁹ s. Ordinary concrete with D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s gives x ≈ 2√(1.58×10⁻³) ≈ 0.079 m = 79 mm, beyond 50 mm cover; UHPC with D = 2×10⁻¹⁴ m²/s gives x ≈ 11 mm. Values are teaching assumptions; diffusion does not apply through interface cracks.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「耐久性、氯離子與接縫防水」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Durability, chloride and joint watertightness\", which statement holds?","options":["UHPC 是無收縮材料，不需要考慮收縮與溫差。","擴散深度近似 x ≈ 2√(D·t)，t = 50 年 ≈ 1.58×10⁹ s。","UHPC 只是強度比較高的混凝土，配比與纖維可以由現場自行調整。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC is a non-shrink material, so shrinkage and temperature need not be considered.","Diffusion depth x ≈ 2√(D·t) with t = 50 years ≈ 1.58×10⁹ s.","UHPC is just stronger concrete, so mix and fibre content can be adjusted on site."],"answer":1,"explanation":"擴散深度近似 x ≈ 2√(D·t)，t = 50 年 ≈ 1.58×10⁹ s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Diffusion depth x ≈ 2√(D·t) with t = 50 years ≈ 1.58×10⁹ s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b053-v13-35","title":"耐久性、氯離子與接縫防水：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Durability, chloride and joint watertightness: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「氯離子擴散深度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Chloride diffusion depth” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"定期以目視、敲擊與裂縫量測檢查接縫與介面；在介面附近的預鑄板鑽取粉末測氯離子濃度剖面，與基準比較；鋪面層若覆蓋接縫，翻修時要檢查其下方介面，並確認排水坡度與排水孔暢通。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Inspect joints and interfaces periodically by eye, sounding and crack measurement; drill powder samples in the precast panel near the interface for chloride profiles compared with the baseline; where an overlay covers the joint, inspect the interface beneath it during resurfacing and confirm drainage falls and outlets are clear. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：耐久設計說明書要分別評估 UHPC、介面與預鑄板的劣化機制與檢查頻率；橋面防水與鋪面層的維護週期與接縫檢查結合，介面裂縫寬度超過門檻時立即封護。","observationEn":"Site practice: The durability statement assesses deterioration mechanisms and inspection frequency separately for the UHPC, the interface and the precast panels; deck waterproofing and overlay maintenance are tied to joint inspection, and interface cracks wider than a threshold are sealed promptly.","failure":"注意干擾：管理單位以為 UHPC 接縫永不需要維護而省略鋪面防水，介面細縫多年持續滲入鹽水，兩側預鑄板邊緣鋼筋腐蝕膨脹、混凝土剝落，最終必須局部打除重做接縫與板邊。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: An owner that assumes UHPC joints never need maintenance and omits overlay waterproofing lets brine seep through interface cracks for years; bars at the panel edges corrode and expand, the concrete spalls and the joint and panel edges must eventually be broken out and recast. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"定期以目視、敲擊與裂縫量測檢查接縫與介面；在介面附近的預鑄板鑽取粉末測氯離子濃度剖面，與基準比較；鋪面層若覆蓋接縫，翻修時要檢查其下方介面，並確認排水坡度與排水孔暢通。","textEn":"Inspect joints and interfaces periodically by eye, sounding and crack measurement; drill powder samples in the precast panel near the interface for chloride profiles compared with the baseline; where an overlay covers the joint, inspect the interface beneath it during resurfacing and confirm drainage falls and outlets are clear.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"耐久設計說明書要分別評估 UHPC、介面與預鑄板的劣化機制與檢查頻率；橋面防水與鋪面層的維護週期與接縫檢查結合，介面裂縫寬度超過門檻時立即封護。","textEn":"The durability statement assesses deterioration mechanisms and inspection frequency separately for the UHPC, the interface and the precast panels; deck waterproofing and overlay maintenance are tied to joint inspection, and interface cracks wider than a threshold are sealed promptly.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「耐久性、氯離子與接縫防水」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Durability, chloride and joint watertightness\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","UHPC 可以像一般混凝土一樣用普通模板，漏一點漿不影響品質。","定期以目視、敲擊與裂縫量測檢查接縫與介面。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","UHPC can use ordinary formwork, and a little paste leakage does not matter.","Inspect joints and interfaces periodically by eye, sounding and crack measurement."],"answer":2,"explanation":"定期以目視、敲擊與裂縫量測檢查接縫與介面；在介面附近的預鑄板鑽取粉末測氯離子濃度剖面，與基準比較；鋪面層若覆蓋接縫，翻修時要檢查其下方介面，並確認排水坡度與排水孔暢通。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Inspect joints and interfaces periodically by eye, sounding and crack measurement; drill powder samples in the precast panel near the interface for chloride profiles compared with the baseline; where an overlay covers the joint, inspect the interface beneath it during resurfacing and confirm drainage falls and outlets are clear. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b053-v13-36","title":"耐久性、氯離子與接縫防水：失效診斷","titleEn":"Durability, chloride and joint watertightness: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「氯離子擴散深度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Chloride diffusion depth” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"管理單位以為 UHPC 接縫永不需要維護而省略鋪面防水，介面細縫多年持續滲入鹽水，兩側預鑄板邊緣鋼筋腐蝕膨脹、混凝土剝落，最終必須局部打除重做接縫與板邊。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"An owner that assumes UHPC joints never need maintenance and omits overlay waterproofing lets brine seep through interface cracks for years; bars at the panel edges corrode and expand, the concrete spalls and the joint and panel edges must eventually be broken out and recast. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：耐久設計要同時處理介面開裂、鋪面層與防水層，以及接縫下方排水。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Durability design must address interface cracking, the wearing surface and waterproofing, and drainage below the joint.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「UHPC 不透水，所以整條接縫及其周邊都不會發生腐蝕。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"UHPC is impermeable, so neither the joint nor its surroundings can corrode.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"管理單位以為 UHPC 接縫永不需要維護而省略鋪面防水，介面細縫多年持續滲入鹽水，兩側預鑄板邊緣鋼筋腐蝕膨脹、混凝土剝落，最終必須局部打除重做接縫與板邊。","textEn":"An owner that assumes UHPC joints never need maintenance and omits overlay waterproofing lets brine seep through interface cracks for years; bars at the panel edges corrode and expand, the concrete spalls and the joint and panel edges must eventually be broken out and recast.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「耐久性、氯離子與接縫防水」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Durability, chloride and joint watertightness\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["管理單位以為 UHPC 接縫永不需要維護而省略鋪面防水，介面細縫多年持續滲入鹽水，兩側預鑄板邊緣鋼筋腐蝕膨脹、混凝土剝落，最終必須局部打除重做接縫與板邊。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","UHPC 接縫耐久性極高，交接後就不需要任何紀錄或維修規劃。"],"optionsEn":["An owner that assumes UHPC joints never need maintenance and omits overlay waterproofing lets brine seep through interface cracks for years.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","UHPC joints are so durable that no records or repair planning are needed after handover."],"answer":0,"explanation":"管理單位以為 UHPC 接縫永不需要維護而省略鋪面防水，介面細縫多年持續滲入鹽水，兩側預鑄板邊緣鋼筋腐蝕膨脹、混凝土剝落，最終必須局部打除重做接縫與板邊。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An owner that assumes UHPC joints never need maintenance and omits overlay waterproofing lets brine seep through interface cracks for years; bars at the panel edges corrode and expand, the concrete spalls and the joint and panel edges must eventually be broken out and recast. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b053-v13-37","title":"維修、改建與工程交接：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Repair, modification and engineering handover: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-36"],"objective":"說明「裂縫滲流與封護門檻」如何影響橋面超高性能混凝土接縫的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Crack seepage and sealing threshold” governs force, deformation or durability in “UHPC bridge-deck closure joints”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"UHPC 接縫的維修與日後改建需要事先規劃：它比一般混凝土硬得多，局部打除、水刀或鋸切都較困難，橋面拓寬或更換板時要預先決定切割位置；鋪面研磨與更換也要避免傷及接縫。滲水量對裂縫寬度極為敏感，因此維修門檻應以裂縫寬度表示，小裂縫及早封護遠比等到鏽水出現再處理便宜。交接文件要讓後續管理者知道每道接縫的位置、材料、試驗與監測基準。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「裂縫滲流與封護門檻」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Repair and later modification of UHPC joints need planning: UHPC is much harder than ordinary concrete, so local breakout, hydrodemolition or saw-cutting is more difficult, and cut lines for future widening or panel replacement should be decided in advance; overlay milling and replacement must also avoid damaging the joints. Leakage is extremely sensitive to crack width, so repair thresholds should be expressed in crack width, and early sealing of small cracks is far cheaper than waiting for rust stains. Handover documents must tell future managers where every joint is and its materials, tests and monitoring baselines. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Crack seepage and sealing threshold” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：平行板裂縫滲流 q = (w³/12μ)·(Δp/L)·ℓ。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Parallel-plate crack flow q = (w³/12μ)·(Δp/L)·ℓ.","failure":"常見誤解：「UHPC 接縫耐久性極高，交接後就不需要任何紀錄或維修規劃。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"UHPC joints are so durable that no records or repair planning are needed after handover.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「裂縫滲流與封護門檻」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Crack seepage and sealing threshold”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-37-k1","title":"維修、改建與工程交接","titleEn":"Repair, modification and engineering handover","text":"UHPC 接縫的維修與日後改建需要事先規劃：它比一般混凝土硬得多，局部打除、水刀或鋸切都較困難，橋面拓寬或更換板時要預先決定切割位置；鋪面研磨與更換也要避免傷及接縫。滲水量對裂縫寬度極為敏感，因此維修門檻應以裂縫寬度表示，小裂縫及早封護遠比等到鏽水出現再處理便宜。","textEn":"Repair and later modification of UHPC joints need planning: UHPC is much harder than ordinary concrete, so local breakout, hydrodemolition or saw-cutting is more difficult, and cut lines for future widening or panel replacement should be decided in advance; overlay milling and replacement must also avoid damaging the joints. Leakage is extremely sensitive to crack width, so repair thresholds should be expressed in crack width, and early sealing of small cracks is far cheaper than waiting for rust stains.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：UHPC 接縫耐久性極高，交接後就不需要任何紀錄或維修規劃。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: UHPC joints are so durable that no records or repair planning are needed after handover. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「維修、改建與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Repair, modification and engineering handover\" is correct?","options":["UHPC 接縫耐久性極高，交接後就不需要任何紀錄或維修規劃。","UHPC 接縫的維修與日後改建需要事先規劃：它比一般混凝土硬得多，局部打除、水刀或鋸切都較困難，橋面拓寬或更換板時要預先決定切割位置。","UHPC 強度極高，所以接縫處絕對不會開裂。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC joints are so durable that no records or repair planning are needed after handover.","Repair and later modification of UHPC joints need planning: UHPC is much harder than ordinary concrete, so local breakout, hydrodemolition or saw-cutting is more difficult, and cut lines for future widening or panel replacement should be decided in advance.","UHPC is so strong that the joint can never crack."],"answer":1,"explanation":"UHPC 接縫的維修與日後改建需要事先規劃：它比一般混凝土硬得多，局部打除、水刀或鋸切都較困難，橋面拓寬或更換板時要預先決定切割位置；鋪面研磨與更換也要避免傷及接縫。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Repair and later modification of UHPC joints need planning: UHPC is much harder than ordinary concrete, so local breakout, hydrodemolition or saw-cutting is more difficult, and cut lines for future widening or panel replacement should be decided in advance; overlay milling and replacement must also avoid damaging the joints. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b053-v13-38","title":"維修、改建與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Repair, modification and engineering handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「裂縫滲流與封護門檻」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Crack seepage and sealing threshold” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：平行板裂縫滲流 q = (w³/12μ)·(Δp/L)·ℓ。w = 0.2 mm、μ = 1×10⁻³ Pa·s、10 mm 積水 Δp ≈ 98 Pa、板厚 L = 0.2 m、裂縫長 12 m：q ≈ 3.9×10⁻⁶ m³/s，約 14 L/h；w 減半為 0.1 mm 時降為約 1.8 L/h（1/8）。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Parallel-plate crack flow q = (w³/12μ)·(Δp/L)·ℓ. With w = 0.2 mm, μ = 1×10⁻³ Pa·s, 10 mm of ponding giving Δp ≈ 98 Pa, deck thickness L = 0.2 m and 12 m of crack: q ≈ 3.9×10⁻⁶ m³/s, about 14 L/h; halving w to 0.1 mm cuts it to about 1.8 L/h (one eighth). Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：定期檢查記錄裂縫寬度與長度並與交接基準比較，超過封護門檻（例如 0.2 mm，教學假設）即排入維修；改建或拓寬前由設計者確認切割位置、鋼筋續接方式與新舊 UHPC 或混凝土的介面處理。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Periodic inspections record crack width and length against handover baselines, scheduling sealing once a threshold (for example 0.2 mm, a teaching assumption) is exceeded; before modification or widening, the designer confirms cut lines, bar splicing and the interface treatment between new and old UHPC or concrete.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"平行板裂縫滲流 q = (w³/12μ)·(Δp/L)·ℓ。w = 0.2 mm、μ = 1×10⁻³ Pa·s、10 mm 積水 Δp ≈ 98 Pa、板厚 L = 0.2 m、裂縫長 12 m：q ≈ 3.9×10⁻⁶ m³/s，約 14 L/h；w 減半為 0.1 mm 時降為約 1.8 L/h（1/8）。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Parallel-plate crack flow q = (w³/12μ)·(Δp/L)·ℓ. With w = 0.2 mm, μ = 1×10⁻³ Pa·s, 10 mm of ponding giving Δp ≈ 98 Pa, deck thickness L = 0.2 m and 12 m of crack: q ≈ 3.9×10⁻⁶ m³/s, about 14 L/h; halving w to 0.1 mm cuts it to about 1.8 L/h (one eighth). Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「維修、改建與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Repair, modification and engineering handover\", which statement holds?","options":["UHPC 握裹力很強，鋼筋搭接長度可以隨意縮短。","UHPC 黏結力很強，預鑄介面平滑也沒關係。","平行板裂縫滲流 q = (w³/12μ)·(Δp/L)·ℓ。"],"optionsEn":["UHPC bonds so well that lap length can be shortened at will.","UHPC bonds so strongly that a smooth precast interface does not matter.","Parallel-plate crack flow q = (w³/12μ)·(Δp/L)·ℓ."],"answer":2,"explanation":"平行板裂縫滲流 q = (w³/12μ)·(Δp/L)·ℓ。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Parallel-plate crack flow q = (w³/12μ)·(Δp/L)·ℓ. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b053-v13-39","title":"維修、改建與工程交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Repair, modification and engineering handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「裂縫滲流與封護門檻」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Crack seepage and sealing threshold” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"定期檢查記錄裂縫寬度與長度並與交接基準比較，超過封護門檻（例如 0.2 mm，教學假設）即排入維修；改建或拓寬前由設計者確認切割位置、鋼筋續接方式與新舊 UHPC 或混凝土的介面處理。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Periodic inspections record crack width and length against handover baselines, scheduling sealing once a threshold (for example 0.2 mm, a teaching assumption) is exceeded; before modification or widening, the designer confirms cut lines, bar splicing and the interface treatment between new and old UHPC or concrete. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接文件應包含每道接縫的位置圖、UHPC 產品與批號、流度與強度試驗、介面處理紀錄、滲水檢查結果、監測基準與裂縫封護門檻；任何切割、銑刨或拓寬工程須先經設計者核定方法與停留點。","observationEn":"Site practice: Handover includes a location plan of every joint, UHPC product and batch numbers, flow and strength tests, interface-treatment records, leak-check results, monitoring baselines and crack-sealing thresholds; any cutting, milling or widening requires the designer's approval of method and hold points first.","failure":"注意干擾：沒有接縫竣工資料，日後鋪面銑刨時切入 UHPC 接縫頂面，纖維外露並形成凹槽；橋面拓寬時在接縫中央鋸切，切斷搭接鋼筋卻無法重新續接，只好擴大打除範圍與封路時間。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Without as-built joint records, later overlay milling cuts into the UHPC joint top, exposing fibres and leaving a trough; widening by saw-cutting through the middle of a joint severs the lap bars with no way to re-splice them, forcing larger breakouts and longer closures. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"定期檢查記錄裂縫寬度與長度並與交接基準比較，超過封護門檻（例如 0.2 mm，教學假設）即排入維修；改建或拓寬前由設計者確認切割位置、鋼筋續接方式與新舊 UHPC 或混凝土的介面處理。","textEn":"Periodic inspections record crack width and length against handover baselines, scheduling sealing once a threshold (for example 0.2 mm, a teaching assumption) is exceeded; before modification or widening, the designer confirms cut lines, bar splicing and the interface treatment between new and old UHPC or concrete.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接文件應包含每道接縫的位置圖、UHPC 產品與批號、流度與強度試驗、介面處理紀錄、滲水檢查結果、監測基準與裂縫封護門檻；任何切割、銑刨或拓寬工程須先經設計者核定方法與停留點。","textEn":"Handover includes a location plan of every joint, UHPC product and batch numbers, flow and strength tests, interface-treatment records, leak-check results, monitoring baselines and crack-sealing thresholds; any cutting, milling or widening requires the designer's approval of method and hold points first.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「維修、改建與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Repair, modification and engineering handover\"?","options":["定期檢查記錄裂縫寬度與長度並與交接基準比較，超過封護門檻（例如 0.2 mm，教學假設）即排入維修。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","UHPC 一定很強，只要按配比拌合就不必做驗收試驗。"],"optionsEn":["Periodic inspections record crack width and length against handover baselines, scheduling sealing once a threshold (for example 0.2 mm, a teaching assumption) is exceeded.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","UHPC is always strong, so batching by the recipe makes acceptance testing unnecessary."],"answer":0,"explanation":"定期檢查記錄裂縫寬度與長度並與交接基準比較，超過封護門檻（例如 0.2 mm，教學假設）即排入維修；改建或拓寬前由設計者確認切割位置、鋼筋續接方式與新舊 UHPC 或混凝土的介面處理。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Periodic inspections record crack width and length against handover baselines, scheduling sealing once a threshold (for example 0.2 mm, a teaching assumption) is exceeded; before modification or widening, the designer confirms cut lines, bar splicing and the interface treatment between new and old UHPC or concrete. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b053-v13-40","title":"維修、改建與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Repair, modification and engineering handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"prerequisiteIds":["b053-v13-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「裂縫滲流與封護門檻」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Crack seepage and sealing threshold” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"沒有接縫竣工資料，日後鋪面銑刨時切入 UHPC 接縫頂面，纖維外露並形成凹槽；橋面拓寬時在接縫中央鋸切，切斷搭接鋼筋卻無法重新續接，只好擴大打除範圍與封路時間。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Without as-built joint records, later overlay milling cuts into the UHPC joint top, exposing fibres and leaving a trough; widening by saw-cutting through the middle of a joint severs the lap bars with no way to re-splice them, forcing larger breakouts and longer closures. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：交接文件要讓後續管理者知道每道接縫的位置、材料、試驗與監測基準。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Handover documents must tell future managers where every joint is and its materials, tests and monitoring baselines.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「UHPC 接縫耐久性極高，交接後就不需要任何紀錄或維修規劃。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"UHPC joints are so durable that no records or repair planning are needed after handover.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b053-v13-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"沒有接縫竣工資料，日後鋪面銑刨時切入 UHPC 接縫頂面，纖維外露並形成凹槽；橋面拓寬時在接縫中央鋸切，切斷搭接鋼筋卻無法重新續接，只好擴大打除範圍與封路時間。","textEn":"Without as-built joint records, later overlay milling cuts into the UHPC joint top, exposing fibres and leaving a trough; widening by saw-cutting through the middle of a joint severs the lap bars with no way to re-splice them, forcing larger breakouts and longer closures.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]},{"id":"b053-v13-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「維修、改建與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Repair, modification and engineering handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","沒有接縫竣工資料，日後鋪面銑刨時切入 UHPC 接縫頂面，纖維外露並形成凹槽；橋面拓寬時在接縫中央鋸切，切斷搭接鋼筋卻無法重新續接，只好擴大打除範圍與封路時間。","UHPC 強度極高，所以接縫處絕對不會開裂。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Without as-built joint records, later overlay milling cuts into the UHPC joint top, exposing fibres and leaving a trough.","UHPC is so strong that the joint can never crack."],"answer":1,"explanation":"沒有接縫竣工資料，日後鋪面銑刨時切入 UHPC 接縫頂面，纖維外露並形成凹槽；橋面拓寬時在接縫中央鋸切，切斷搭接鋼筋卻無法重新續接，只好擴大打除範圍與封路時間。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Without as-built joint records, later overlay milling cuts into the UHPC joint top, exposing fibres and leaving a trough; widening by saw-cutting through the middle of a joint severs the lap bars with no way to re-splice them, forcing larger breakouts and longer closures. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v13s-fhwa-hrt-14-084","v13s-fhwa-edc4-uhpc","v13s-wiki-uhpc"],"curriculumVersion":13,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
